Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79063,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14c10f08d51b0bb60135247cd2dab4ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Katie,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement. Yes, a symbolic wedding is much cheaper and much less stressful than a legal one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think getting married 3 days after your scheduled arrival date is ideal. This way, you get one day to get on the resort, another to check out the venue, marry on the third, and then your group gets to relax and enjoy the rest of their time after.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It sounds like you&#039;re doing a lot on your own (trying to contact the resorts, compare hotels, and compare ceremony types). Your best bet is to find a good TA who does a lot of wedding groups. You can get lots of suggestions here. Mine is really good. Let me know if you want me to forward her contacts.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895148,"PostDate":1430539115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Katie,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your engagement. Yes, a symbolic wedding is much cheaper and much less stressful than a legal one.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think getting married 3 days after your scheduled arrival date is ideal. This way, you get one day to get on the resort, another to check out the venue, marry on the third, and then your group gets to relax and enjoy the rest of their time after.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It sounds like you're doing a lot on your own (trying to contact the resorts, compare hotels, and compare ceremony types). Your best bet is to find a good TA who does a lot of wedding groups. You can get lots of suggestions here. Mine is really good. Let me know if you want me to forward her contacts.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
