kes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab80bb2af5eadfc5c95b9c15344ae173","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Giocivs88\"] Did Jessica send you options for cake? I haven&#039;t seen those yet! I keep hearing about one of the cakes... I&#039;m not sure the name but if I saw it I&#039;d .. remember! haha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893941,"PostDate":1429722594,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281659\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281659-giocivs88\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Giocivs88<\/span><\/a> Did Jessica send you options for cake? I haven't seen those yet! I keep hearing about one of the cakes... I'm not sure the name but if I saw it I'd .. remember! haha<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423178562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.174.234.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0d2c49d606da359cea370e96921a68a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"victoriasalv\"] &amp;nbsp;yes she sent me 3 pics but I&#039;m not a fan of the way they look for a wedding lol&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;she told me that if i have pics of what i like i can send them to her and she will give them to the baker&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica;\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=69f1c40c8b&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=14cddc8d7f870c4a&amp;amp;attid=0.2&amp;amp;disp=inline&amp;amp;safe=1&amp;amp;attbid=ANGjdJ8MFsk4lU1MfnAk3nLtYT3_RmyxNBDG1sPoY-pmbzXgZPduwRxGsMyiaHL6RHKFFOGI_YnAqZ-bVQullkl8FcsefVaFyImRGHVNkIXfIiegPEZMiLwWc2JlfVQ&amp;amp;ats=1429719245938&amp;amp;rm=14cddc8d7f870c4a&amp;amp;zw&amp;amp;sz=w2560-h2310\" alt=\"?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=69f1c40c8b&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=14cddc8\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=69f1c40c8b&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=14cddc8d7f870c4a&amp;amp;attid=0.1&amp;amp;disp=inline&amp;amp;safe=1&amp;amp;attbid=ANGjdJ-p_AEpp4Jmhao9KPbHyGy_lUH7ghBwgxDJVociMykByRN6FH3A6dO6vjEZmWT4i8u235tGMCu9cCdQlOt7w_t67JInmTZ_fV6px1ou-9CoLT5TXpJRduTjt_A&amp;amp;ats=1429719245938&amp;amp;rm=14cddc8d7f870c4a&amp;amp;zw&amp;amp;sz=w2560-h2310\" alt=\"?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=69f1c40c8b&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=14cddc8\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=69f1c40c8b&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=14cddc8d7f870c4a&amp;amp;attid=0.3&amp;amp;disp=inline&amp;amp;safe=1&amp;amp;attbid=ANGjdJ8i9Z9KkgN7qRPFVKtyBrlmizDlyzhrfKpVxIC_Ud_m4AY1hhAP40E6gcKlvo4yyDPWkFBmSeZTsw0ktKqi7b3IlXe9U7UMyuHYDNuHo6NXsqqxEJqo-tA8sac&amp;amp;ats=1429719245938&amp;amp;rm=14cddc8d7f870c4a&amp;amp;zw&amp;amp;sz=w2560-h2310\" alt=\"?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=69f1c40c8b&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=14cddc8\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=69f1c40c8b&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=14cddc8d7f870c4a&amp;amp;attid=0.4&amp;amp;disp=inline&amp;amp;safe=1&amp;amp;attbid=ANGjdJ8dYrjkud32i5ToTv0R4XOl3JWX1Aqjp-AsqeD6gG9say5RnuB-3w6BalFrxZ0AUNAyME7rdLQwUP1O6bNMqZXcsvmMfN-PCWTuvSmV1f6bq3_dR5Dt8LE0TWI&amp;amp;ats=1429719245938&amp;amp;rm=14cddc8d7f870c4a&amp;amp;zw&amp;amp;sz=w2560-h2310\" alt=\"?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=69f1c40c8b&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=14cddc8\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;she also said if we want to add flowers its 15 dollars each for lily or rose&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893943,"PostDate":1429723060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282014\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">victoriasalv<\/span><\/a> \u00a0yes she sent me 3 pics but I'm not a fan of the way they look for a wedding lol\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>she told me that if i have pics of what i like i can send them to her and she will give them to the baker\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Helvetica\"><\/p><br \/><p><\/p>\n<br \/><p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/?ui=2&ik=69f1c40c8b&view=fimg&th=14cddc8d7f870c4a&attid=0.2&disp=inline&safe=1&attbid=ANGjdJ8MFsk4lU1MfnAk3nLtYT3_RmyxNBDG1sPoY-pmbzXgZPduwRxGsMyiaHL6RHKFFOGI_YnAqZ-bVQullkl8FcsefVaFyImRGHVNkIXfIiegPEZMiLwWc2JlfVQ&ats=1429719245938&rm=14cddc8d7f870c4a&zw&sz=w2560-h2310\" alt=\"?ui=2&ik=69f1c40c8b&view=fimg&th=14cddc8\"><\/span><\/p>\n<br \/><p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/?ui=2&ik=69f1c40c8b&view=fimg&th=14cddc8d7f870c4a&attid=0.1&disp=inline&safe=1&attbid=ANGjdJ-p_AEpp4Jmhao9KPbHyGy_lUH7ghBwgxDJVociMykByRN6FH3A6dO6vjEZmWT4i8u235tGMCu9cCdQlOt7w_t67JInmTZ_fV6px1ou-9CoLT5TXpJRduTjt_A&ats=1429719245938&rm=14cddc8d7f870c4a&zw&sz=w2560-h2310\" alt=\"?ui=2&ik=69f1c40c8b&view=fimg&th=14cddc8\"><\/span><\/p>\n<br \/><p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/?ui=2&ik=69f1c40c8b&view=fimg&th=14cddc8d7f870c4a&attid=0.3&disp=inline&safe=1&attbid=ANGjdJ8i9Z9KkgN7qRPFVKtyBrlmizDlyzhrfKpVxIC_Ud_m4AY1hhAP40E6gcKlvo4yyDPWkFBmSeZTsw0ktKqi7b3IlXe9U7UMyuHYDNuHo6NXsqqxEJqo-tA8sac&ats=1429719245938&rm=14cddc8d7f870c4a&zw&sz=w2560-h2310\" alt=\"?ui=2&ik=69f1c40c8b&view=fimg&th=14cddc8\"><\/span><\/p>\n<br \/><p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/?ui=2&ik=69f1c40c8b&view=fimg&th=14cddc8d7f870c4a&attid=0.4&disp=inline&safe=1&attbid=ANGjdJ8dYrjkud32i5ToTv0R4XOl3JWX1Aqjp-AsqeD6gG9say5RnuB-3w6BalFrxZ0AUNAyME7rdLQwUP1O6bNMqZXcsvmMfN-PCWTuvSmV1f6bq3_dR5Dt8LE0TWI&ats=1429719245938&rm=14cddc8d7f870c4a&zw&sz=w2560-h2310\" alt=\"?ui=2&ik=69f1c40c8b&view=fimg&th=14cddc8\"><\/span><\/p>\n<br \/><p>she also said if we want to add flowers its 15 dollars each for lily or rose<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"giociviletti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.229.218.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420845388,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281659.jpg?_r=1430699804","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Giocivs88","Id":281659,"Name":"Giocivs88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d485e59a10424f1e1899683b0575b90e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;victoriasalv&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The cake options (flavors) are in the wedding&amp;nbsp;package info packet from Jessica. They are the more detailed info packets. She sent me the one for the gold package upon sending her our travel confirmation\/info.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m&amp;nbsp;waiting to hear back from her to see if we can do a vanilla cake with lemon filling and coconut frosting. We&#039;ll see. I heard their fruit fillings are good.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893946,"PostDate":1429723477,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>victoriasalv<\/span><\/a>\u00a0- The cake options (flavors) are in the wedding\u00a0package info packet from Jessica. They are the more detailed info packets. She sent me the one for the gold package upon sending her our travel confirmation\/info.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm\u00a0waiting to hear back from her to see if we can do a vanilla cake with lemon filling and coconut frosting. We'll see. I heard their fruit fillings are good.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"510e97bef83b052c8d0795cd9ed3297b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Crap I cant&#039; see those images. Does that mean I need to post more? Haha&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JenniferH114\"]. I didn&#039;t get that one but I&#039;ll ask her. Since we&#039;re going through funjet I get a \"planner\" in the USA that deals directly with the resort so I kind of don&#039; thave direct access to Jessica. I have the packet with the flowers, centerpieces. So there is one just for Gold?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893949,"PostDate":1429723999,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Crap I cant' see those images. Does that mean I need to post more? Haha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a>. I didn't get that one but I'll ask her. Since we're going through funjet I get a \"planner\" in the USA that deals directly with the resort so I kind of don' thave direct access to Jessica. I have the packet with the flowers, centerpieces. So there is one just for Gold?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423178562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.174.234.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c965afc5ee58ca62f472753f842da6e7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] i didn&#039;t get that either, i just happened to ask her yesterday&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893950,"PostDate":1429724739,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> i didn't get that either, i just happened to ask her yesterday\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"giociviletti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.229.218.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420845388,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281659.jpg?_r=1430699804","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Giocivs88","Id":281659,"Name":"Giocivs88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9117446b6edd5368abf5d5b831d28c1e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"victoriasalv\" post=\"1893906\" timestamp=\"1429706602\"]\n@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] - You&#039;re right! I always was thinking (in the states) I would do a donation in the guests names to a charity. Since I felt those add up quick and not sure if I could think of something people would actually KEEP! I love the fan idea. And the Maracas. Can I ask where you ordered the fans\/maracas from?\n\nAlso @[member=\"Sabes44\"] - I think I&#039;m leaning towards maracas also! Where did you get yours?\n\nOh and to all of you - Did you plan your wedding playlist? Are you using your iPhone?[\/quote]We got our maracas through Amols www.amols.com.  They are not custom, but look authentic and great pricing.  Perfect for what I wanted.  We will be using our phone for the playlist.  That is still on the list of things to do and stressing me out!  Since we only have one weekend both at home before the wedding eeeeek!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893951,"PostDate":1429725234,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>victoriasalv, on 22 April 2015 - 05:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> - You're right! I always was thinking (in the states) I would do a donation in the guests names to a charity. Since I felt those add up quick and not sure if I could think of something people would actually KEEP! I love the fan idea. And the Maracas. Can I ask where you ordered the fans\/maracas from?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sabes44<\/span><\/a> - I think I'm leaning towards maracas also! Where did you get yours?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh and to all of you - Did you plan your wedding playlist? Are you using your iPhone?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>We got our maracas through Amols www.amols.com. \u00a0They are not custom, but look authentic and great pricing. \u00a0Perfect for what I wanted. \u00a0We will be using our phone for the playlist. \u00a0That is still on the list of things to do and stressing me out! \u00a0Since we only have one weekend both at home before the wedding eeeeek!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403212476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3001a49d7838b9f9ed8215307a1916d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes, there is a more detailed info packet for each package.&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m sure you could just ask Jessica for the cake info, too.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893952,"PostDate":1429725674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes, there is a more detailed info packet for each package.\u00a0I'm sure you could just ask Jessica for the cake info, too.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"634534e1a6ab73bb4bdb55c464602bd9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great I&#039;ll ask! So did you all just now hear that your location is booked\/reserved? When I booked the lobster house she said she can&#039;t confirm until two months out. That&#039;s hard for a far in advance planner! Oh well!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks @[member=\"JenniferH114\"] - I&#039;ll ask for it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893971,"PostDate":1429739715,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great I'll ask! So did you all just now hear that your location is booked\/reserved? When I booked the lobster house she said she can't confirm until two months out. That's hard for a far in advance planner! Oh well!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> - I'll ask for it!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423178562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9b36c75b50d4f753c7c61d79348e2f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;victoriasalv&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;- My locations&amp;nbsp;have been confirmed since last summer\/whenever we decided on them. I believe that&amp;nbsp;two month rule&amp;nbsp;only applies to the Lobster House.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893973,"PostDate":1429740125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>victoriasalv<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0- My locations\u00a0have been confirmed since last summer\/whenever we decided on them. I believe that\u00a0two month rule\u00a0only applies to the Lobster House.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1183,"TotalPages":119,"CurrentPage":1150,"NextPage":1160,"PreviousPage":1140,"LastPage":1180},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
