Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2f200d3188d984a08a8bd96a5028501","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sabes44&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;- I had actually requested a late afternoon appt. They came back with a 6pm Aqua Wellness and 7pm appt. for the package. I didn&#039;t even question it. We are total beach\/pool bums during the day, so I didn&#039;t want it interrupting our time in the sun! That does seem pretty late as a standard appt. time, though.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894596,"PostDate":1430167841,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>Sabes44<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0- I had actually requested a late afternoon appt. They came back with a 6pm Aqua Wellness and 7pm appt. for the package. I didn't even question it. We are total beach\/pool bums during the day, so I didn't want it interrupting our time in the sun! That does seem pretty late as a standard appt. time, though.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b76b42a71a82d22bbc9ce88e90ca6a61","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yup, I got the same thing! &amp;nbsp;I figured that will be the first day it is just us, so we can be beach\/pool bums all day, get pampered and just order room service for dinner. I think when that time comes, it will be much needed break from everything!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894598,"PostDate":1430167995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yup, I got the same thing! \u00a0I figured that will be the first day it is just us, so we can be beach\/pool bums all day, get pampered and just order room service for dinner. I think when that time comes, it will be much needed break from everything!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403212476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d17bafc1f50de918483c9a33ca6be0c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s so awesme ladies about the love birds package. That&#039;s with the Gold, correct?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think you both answered this once before but I can&#039;t find it... how early did you book your hair apt?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894676,"PostDate":1430227274,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That's so awesme ladies about the love birds package. That's with the Gold, correct?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think you both answered this once before but I can't find it... how early did you book your hair apt?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423178562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.85.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c4493011b350b8e6edc1ad781e7ca8a","RawContent":"I booked our four appointments in early November, but, then again, I had most everything in order by December. You don&#039;t have to book it that far in advance.","Attachments":[],"Id":1894677,"PostDate":1430228087,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I booked our four appointments in early November, but, then again, I had most everything in order by December. You don't have to book it that far in advance. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.69.39.178","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7532bca7852819654f6026e49d03c6e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Good morning all. I am in the very early stages of planning our 2016 destination wedding and thought we had decided fully on Excellence. We are now considering the El Dorado Royale as well and was hoping that someone could tell me if there is an official ERC forum as there is for the EDR. I would love to be able to attempt to compare the two.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance for any help!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894940,"PostDate":1430410540,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Good morning all. I am in the very early stages of planning our 2016 destination wedding and thought we had decided fully on Excellence. We are now considering the El Dorado Royale as well and was hoping that someone could tell me if there is an official ERC forum as there is for the EDR. I would love to be able to attempt to compare the two.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance for any help!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaimekraus@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.69.39.178","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430409765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282920.jpg?_r=1430406986","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaimeCKL","Id":282920,"Name":"JaimeCKL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"25bbe04b1da9f05b2073f9bed32301ec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282920-jaimeckl\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;JaimeCKL&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Congratulations! I have been on this site since last summer and this is the main thread for all things ERC. The ERC girls on here have been really helpful in case you have any specific questions. Many of us have actually started way back at the first page and read through all of the posts (crazy but extremely helpful).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck with your decision! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894942,"PostDate":1430410828,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282920-jaimeckl\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>JaimeCKL<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0- Congratulations! I have been on this site since last summer and this is the main thread for all things ERC. The ERC girls on here have been really helpful in case you have any specific questions. Many of us have actually started way back at the first page and read through all of the posts (crazy but extremely helpful).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck with your decision! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"278a06937849975faff6a54b92aadbd5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@JaumeCKL - CONGRATS! When are you planning your wedding? I am getting married April 2016 and being a planner, I found this thread and couldn&#039;t be happier. I read though the entire thing and answered most of my questions before my first post. Everyone is extremely helpful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve never stayed at El Dorado but have heard fabulous this. I was actually trying to decide between ERC and El Dorado before my first trip to ERC. After I went I just fell in love. Feel free to ask questions but def peek back on past posts and you&#039;ll get a feel for a lot and some AWESOME reviews. There is a review page on this site for the resort itself you may want to read those also.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894946,"PostDate":1430411920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@JaumeCKL - CONGRATS! When are you planning your wedding? I am getting married April 2016 and being a planner, I found this thread and couldn't be happier. I read though the entire thing and answered most of my questions before my first post. Everyone is extremely helpful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've never stayed at El Dorado but have heard fabulous this. I was actually trying to decide between ERC and El Dorado before my first trip to ERC. After I went I just fell in love. Feel free to ask questions but def peek back on past posts and you'll get a feel for a lot and some AWESOME reviews. There is a review page on this site for the resort itself you may want to read those also.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423178562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.199.77.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b66397785f00f2643615bea434b5ebc4","RawContent":"Hey girls, is anyone bringing their own chair sashes or ribbons? If so where did you get yours from? The website I used hasn&#039;t even shipped my order yet, which was placed on April 13th :\/","Attachments":[],"Id":1895043,"PostDate":1430494257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey girls, is anyone bringing their own chair sashes or ribbons? If so where did you get yours from? The website I used hasn't even shipped my order yet, which was placed on April 13th :\/\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"giociviletti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.229.218.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420845388,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281659.jpg?_r=1430699804","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Giocivs88","Id":281659,"Name":"Giocivs88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22bd4fb93f1cd1c90d3c81a6833d3dc3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281659-giocivs88\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Giocivs88&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;- We are bringing our own. I ordered from weddinglinensdirect.com. They came really fast and look great.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895047,"PostDate":1430495183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281659-giocivs88\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>Giocivs88<\/span><\/a>\u00a0- We are bringing our own. I ordered from weddinglinensdirect.com. They came really fast and look great.<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ae1a44c2cea2f8aa436ec447802b5d8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;TA Babs and TA Wendy have booked many weddings with Excellence and are very knowledgeable with the ins and outs, deposit terms, group amenities, room categories etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let us know how we can help. &amp;nbsp;You can contact us via the link in my signature.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895070,"PostDate":1430503151,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>TA Babs and TA Wendy have booked many weddings with Excellence and are very knowledgeable with the ins and outs, deposit terms, group amenities, room categories etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let us know how we can help. \u00a0You can contact us via the link in my signature.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137227820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,