elcome fiesta and reception.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895104,"PostDate":1430510425,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>victoriasalv<\/span><\/a>\u00a0- The only additional flowers I purchased\u00a0are for my sister (MOH). I ordered a smaller bouquet to replicate mine, but in all white. We are making our own centerpieces and bring other d\u00e9cor for the welcome fiesta and reception.<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1183,"TotalPages":119,"CurrentPage":1180,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":1170,"LastPage":1180},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
