Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e180ae6725d96f48be58ad3f9a07373b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We just signed this week with Ivan Luckie photography!&amp;nbsp; I am so happy that we got him.&amp;nbsp; I think his pictures are so amazing:) Before you choose a photpgrapher any other outside vendor check with Excellence to see&amp;nbsp;if they allow them.&amp;nbsp; Some outside vendors are not allowed on the property.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was very confused as well!&amp;nbsp; I just kept on emailing nayeli with all my questions and she got back to me very quickly. She told me that about a week before the wedding, she need certain things like floral arragements and food, once we get down there, we pick everything else.&amp;nbsp;She has sent me choices so&amp;nbsp;I can just start looking and planning now. &amp;nbsp;I think that is what will happen.&amp;nbsp; Email gloria and ask her.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You said your wedidng was going to be small-how many people? We have so far booked 12 people (not including me and fiance) and expecting maybe 10 more.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1555583,"PostDate":1323475760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We just signed this week with Ivan Luckie photography!\u00a0 I am so happy that we got him.\u00a0 I think his pictures are so amazing:) Before you choose a photpgrapher any other outside vendor check with Excellence to see\u00a0if they allow them.\u00a0 Some outside vendors are not allowed on the property.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was very confused as well!\u00a0 I just kept on emailing nayeli with all my questions and she got back to me very quickly. She told me that about a week before the wedding, she need certain things like floral arragements and food, once we get down there, we pick everything else.\u00a0She has sent me choices so\u00a0I can just start looking and planning now. \u00a0I think that is what will happen.\u00a0 Email gloria and ask her.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You said your wedidng was going to be small-how many people? We have so far booked 12 people (not including me and fiance) and expecting maybe 10 more.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyc531@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309290733,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241691.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BunnyBride","Id":241691,"Name":"BunnyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1abbb37c70a0d42ce51b7f0d678a21b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We&#039;re using Juan Navarro as our photographer and doing a TTD. &amp;nbsp;Nayeli said we do not need day passes for Juan and his assistant, we just have to pay the $500 outside vendor fee. &amp;nbsp;He has been GREAT to communicate with so far. &amp;nbsp;Very quick with answers to my questions. &amp;nbsp;Nayeli has sent me some catalogs of flowers (bridal bouquet, centerpieces, hair flowers, etc) and menus for both the Love and Gold packages. &amp;nbsp;She said flower selections and menus must be decided about 3 weeks before the wedding. &amp;nbsp;She said this is to ensure the flowers and food are available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1555972,"PostDate":1323641400,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We're using Juan Navarro as our photographer and doing a TTD. \u00a0Nayeli said we do not need day passes for Juan and his assistant, we just have to pay the $500 outside vendor fee. \u00a0He has been GREAT to communicate with so far. \u00a0Very quick with answers to my questions. \u00a0Nayeli has sent me some catalogs of flowers (bridal bouquet, centerpieces, hair flowers, etc) and menus for both the Love and Gold packages. \u00a0She said flower selections and menus must be decided about 3 weeks before the wedding. \u00a0She said this is to ensure the flowers and food are available.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jconner17@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323641154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248531.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jill Conner","Id":248531,"Name":"Jill Conner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7be81ee5561e2d3ededc1653acb4240c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We just booked Derek Campbell last week (Photos in Cancun) and are very excited! I was not thrilled with the $500 outside vendor fee but I didn&#039;t really care for the photographer they had on site. Ivan Luckie is great! That is so exciting for you!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I just emailed Gloria to get more info on the wedding. I think it&#039;s kind of cool that we don&#039;t have to make all of the decisions until almost wedding time. I feel like that would really stress some brides out, but I am pretty laid back. I just feel like it gives me time to focus on my at-home reception for now and get all those details figured out.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are planning on having about 20 people down for the wedding. It is starting to get frustrating though because we have people saying they are interested in going but no one is ready to book. Now our prices have gone up $300 and people are complaining about the price increase. We keep telling them to put down a deposit to keep the lower prices locked in. Drives me crazy!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Are you using someone on-site for hair and makeup or are you thinking about hiring someone for that?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1556170,"PostDate":1323708196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We just booked Derek Campbell last week (Photos in Cancun) and are very excited! I was not thrilled with the $500 outside vendor fee but I didn't really care for the photographer they had on site. Ivan Luckie is great! That is so exciting for you!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just emailed Gloria to get more info on the wedding. I think it's kind of cool that we don't have to make all of the decisions until almost wedding time. I feel like that would really stress some brides out, but I am pretty laid back. I just feel like it gives me time to focus on my at-home reception for now and get all those details figured out.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are planning on having about 20 people down for the wedding. It is starting to get frustrating though because we have people saying they are interested in going but no one is ready to book. Now our prices have gone up $300 and people are complaining about the price increase. We keep telling them to put down a deposit to keep the lower prices locked in. Drives me crazy!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Are you using someone on-site for hair and makeup or are you thinking about hiring someone for that?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b78c9a04eb5be652eab7d2bb153af43","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Jill! What is your wedding date? I love that you are doing a TTD...are you wearing your actual dress for that? We want to do a TTD (haven&#039;t decided if it&#039;s in the budget yet), and I can&#039;t decide if I want to wear my actual dress or if I want to buy a cheap one just for that. If we weren&#039;t having an at-home reception 2 weeks after our MX Wedding, I could care less about wearing my actual dress - I guess I&#039;m just worried I&#039;ll ruin it and not have a dress for our reception LOL&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1556171,"PostDate":1323708389,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Jill! What is your wedding date? I love that you are doing a TTD...are you wearing your actual dress for that? We want to do a TTD (haven't decided if it's in the budget yet), and I can't decide if I want to wear my actual dress or if I want to buy a cheap one just for that. If we weren't having an at-home reception 2 weeks after our MX Wedding, I could care less about wearing my actual dress - I guess I'm just worried I'll ruin it and not have a dress for our reception LOL<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09cbdd93bb318a64fddd6a26e7022954","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Our wedding is Friday 06\/29\/12.&amp;nbsp; Yes, I am wearing my actual dress for the TTD.&amp;nbsp; We&#039;re also doing an AHR a few weeks after our wedding in Mexico, but it is going to be super-casual and I&#039;ll probably just buy a more casual, short white dress for that.&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t see myself wearing my dress again at home AT ALL, so I figured why not destroy it!?!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Yes, I&#039;m planning to use someone on-site for hair and make-up.&amp;nbsp; We&#039;re arriving in Mexico a few days before our wedding, so I was going to see if I could do a \"trial run\" to see how things look, but not sure.&amp;nbsp; I actually don&#039;t mind doing my own makeup, and I don&#039;t want anything&lt;em&gt; too&lt;\/em&gt; fancy done to my hair anyway!&amp;nbsp; Been stalking down hairstyles on Pinterest!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1556289,"PostDate":1323718199,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Our wedding is Friday 06\/29\/12.\u00a0 Yes, I am wearing my actual dress for the TTD.\u00a0 We're also doing an AHR a few weeks after our wedding in Mexico, but it is going to be super-casual and I'll probably just buy a more casual, short white dress for that.\u00a0 I can't see myself wearing my dress again at home AT ALL, so I figured why not destroy it!?!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yes, I'm planning to use someone on-site for hair and make-up.\u00a0 We're arriving in Mexico a few days before our wedding, so I was going to see if I could do a \"trial run\" to see how things look, but not sure.\u00a0 I actually don't mind doing my own makeup, and I don't want anything<em> too<\/em> fancy done to my hair anyway!\u00a0 Been stalking down hairstyles on Pinterest!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"JConner17@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1318783185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246764.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JConner17","Id":246764,"Name":"JConner17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce028c095ad80faff54964f0070a3ddb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; OMG me too! I love Pinterest! Sorry, I didn&#039;t realize you had already posted your wedding date on the first page of the thread. I don&#039;t mind doing my own make-up but I think I&#039;m going to treat myself for the wedding. I don&#039;t wear a whole lot of make-up to begin with, so I think it will be cool to let a pro handle it. I want to do it for my girls too but I&#039;m still trying to decide if it will fit in the budget. This wedding is becoming so expensive! LOL&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1556567,"PostDate":1323796704,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> OMG me too! I love Pinterest! Sorry, I didn't realize you had already posted your wedding date on the first page of the thread. I don't mind doing my own make-up but I think I'm going to treat myself for the wedding. I don't wear a whole lot of make-up to begin with, so I think it will be cool to let a pro handle it. I want to do it for my girls too but I'm still trying to decide if it will fit in the budget. This wedding is becoming so expensive! LOL<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97c63f582ac39188fbcd567759db77d5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; By the way...for all of you ladies not working with Gloria...did your WC tell you how much it would cost to have an outside photographer? Gloria told me it was going to cost $500 but from reading the other thread, people are saying it should only be $150 for the photographer to purchase a day pass. Just curious what you all have been told?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1556710,"PostDate":1323820313,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> By the way...for all of you ladies not working with Gloria...did your WC tell you how much it would cost to have an outside photographer? Gloria told me it was going to cost $500 but from reading the other thread, people are saying it should only be $150 for the photographer to purchase a day pass. Just curious what you all have been told?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5fadb85bb2d871ab54423641062e0ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m not working with Gloria.&amp;nbsp; Nayeli told me that it is a $500 flat-fee, and that we do NOT need to purchase additional guest passes for the photographer and his assistant.&amp;nbsp; (I was thinking there was a $500 outside vendor fee + $150 (each) for the photographer and his assistant&#039;s day passes!&amp;nbsp; I was like WOAH $800 is A LOT!.&amp;nbsp; $500 is still a lot... but apparently \"guest passes\" are a non-issue after you pay the $500 outside vendor fee...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1556914,"PostDate":1323876749,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm not working with Gloria.\u00a0 Nayeli told me that it is a $500 flat-fee, and that we do NOT need to purchase additional guest passes for the photographer and his assistant.\u00a0 (I was thinking there was a $500 outside vendor fee + $150 (each) for the photographer and his assistant's day passes!\u00a0 I was like WOAH $800 is A LOT!.\u00a0 $500 is still a lot... but apparently \"guest passes\" are a non-issue after you pay the $500 outside vendor fee...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"JConner17@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1318783185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246764.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JConner17","Id":246764,"Name":"JConner17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"914dc04166a45bd224107e60f441c697","RawContent":"I was going to use the spa at the reosrt for hair and makeup.  I am thinking of doing a trial run here at home, taking a lot of pictures and showing them at the resort.  Has anyone heard anything about them? Are they good at hair and makeup? I hope so...\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]JConner17[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Our wedding is Friday 06\/29\/12.  Yes, I am wearing my actual dress for the TTD.  We&#039;re also doing an AHR a few weeks after our wedding in Mexico, but it is going to be super-casual and I&#039;ll probably just buy a more casual, short white dress for that.  I can&#039;t see myself wearing my dress again at home AT ALL, so I figured why not destroy it!?! \n \n Yes, I&#039;m planning to use someone on-site for hair and make-up.  We&#039;re arriving in Mexico a few days before our wedding, so I was going to see if I could do a \"trial run\" to see how things look, but not sure.  I actually don&#039;t mind doing my own makeup, and I don&#039;t want anything[i] too[\/i] fancy done to my hair anyway!  Been stalking down hairstyles on Pinterest![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1557926,"PostDate":1324219265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I was going to use the spa at the reosrt for hair and makeup.\u00a0 I am thinking of doing a trial run here at home, taking a lot of pictures and showing them at the resort.\u00a0 Has anyone heard anything about them? Are they good at hair and makeup? I hope so...<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JConner17<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Our wedding is Friday 06\/29\/12.\u00a0 Yes, I am wearing my actual dress for the TTD.\u00a0 We're also doing an AHR a few weeks after our wedding in Mexico, but it is going to be super-casual and I'll probably just buy a more casual, short white dress for that.\u00a0 I can't see myself wearing my dress again at home AT ALL, so I figured why not destroy it!?!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yes, I'm planning to use someone on-site for hair and make-up.\u00a0 We're arriving in Mexico a few days before our wedding, so I was going to see if I could do a \"trial run\" to see how things look, but not sure.\u00a0 I actually don't mind doing my own makeup, and I don't want anything<em> too<\/em> fancy done to my hair anyway!\u00a0 Been stalking down hairstyles on Pinterest!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyc531@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309290733,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241691.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BunnyBride","Id":241691,"Name":"BunnyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e326dc6a8d83c5f2cf4ddfeca976151","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I read some reviews on the other thread that the spa does a pretty good job with hair and makeup. I haven&#039;t decided what to do yet. I&#039;m still trying to figure out how much everything costs. The flower\/gazebo\/cake options are really confusing to me...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1558182,"PostDate":1324317538,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I read some reviews on the other thread that the spa does a pretty good job with hair and makeup. I haven't decided what to do yet. I'm still trying to figure out how much everything costs. The flower\/gazebo\/cake options are really confusing to me...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1183,"TotalPages":119,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":1180},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
