tLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5d59a65eda5575551c979d65e6585ad","RawContent":"Of course! Nothing to be nervous about :) I would just suggest bringing pics of what you&#039;d like done!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]BunnyBride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Thank you for letting us know! I feel better now having them do it:)\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1584219,"PostDate":1329704102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Of course! Nothing to be nervous about <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I would just suggest bringing pics of what you'd like done!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>BunnyBride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Thank you for letting us know! I feel better now having them do it:)<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245223537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f3c08c3610a9d823ae06fdfe6a912fc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Curious about the locations you choose:) Where are you ladies having your welcome cocktail party? Cocktail hour? Reception?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1586517,"PostDate":1330106571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Curious about the locations you choose:) Where are you ladies having your welcome cocktail party? Cocktail hour? Reception?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309491991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6649a50f7dade54c3bc9f555e186aeb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Curious about the locations you choose:) Where are you ladies having your welcome cocktail party? Cocktail hour? Reception?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1586519,"PostDate":1330106608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Curious about the locations you choose:) Where are you ladies having your welcome cocktail party? Cocktail hour? Reception?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309491991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b82e6b9659bcfac25a0ace02465117d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are having our welcome dinner at Toscana and our \"reception\" at Agave. We are doing a semi-private dinner in place of a traditional reception because we are spending so much money on our AHR.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am getting so excited! I just bought passport covers and luggage tags for my 5 girls and I&#039;ve been basically glued to Ebay the last 2 weeks scouring for OOT bag loot!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How are you ladies doing with planning and everything?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1586526,"PostDate":1330107217,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are having our welcome dinner at Toscana and our \"reception\" at Agave. We are doing a semi-private dinner in place of a traditional reception because we are spending so much money on our AHR.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am getting so excited! I just bought passport covers and luggage tags for my 5 girls and I've been basically glued to Ebay the last 2 weeks scouring for OOT bag loot!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How are you ladies doing with planning and everything?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d27edbfd7e89ce003a651be60bc9b2c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are having the ceremony on the beach, cocktail hour on the pier and recepetion at the Lobster house.&amp;nbsp; We will be having a welcome drinks\/appetizers, but I just don&#039;t know where yet.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The due date for the rsvp&#039;s are Feb 29.&amp;nbsp; Once I get a final count I will start ordering more &amp;nbsp;things and send down in one big box so we don&#039;t have to carry it. I have so far bought things here and there..like chair shashes, fans and cocktail hour napkins.&amp;nbsp; The next thing is all the stuff for the oot bags. Im nervous&amp;nbsp;about sending gatorade powder sticks and advil\/pepto\/immoduim down there.&amp;nbsp; Not sure if they will confiscate it at customs:(&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1586762,"PostDate":1330136338,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are having the ceremony on the beach, cocktail hour on the pier and recepetion at the Lobster house.\u00a0 We will be having a welcome drinks\/appetizers, but I just don't know where yet.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The due date for the rsvp's are Feb 29.\u00a0 Once I get a final count I will start ordering more \u00a0things and send down in one big box so we don't have to carry it. I have so far bought things here and there..like chair shashes, fans and cocktail hour napkins.\u00a0 The next thing is all the stuff for the oot bags. Im nervous\u00a0about sending gatorade powder sticks and advil\/pepto\/immoduim down there.\u00a0 Not sure if they will confiscate it at customs:(<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyc531@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309290733,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241691.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BunnyBride","Id":241691,"Name":"BunnyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5989979540e7b7cd01611879c1b67307","RawContent":"Hey Stella! \n \n We had our welcome party at Agave, Cocktail hour on the pier (amazing) and reception on the balcony off the side of the lobby! I&#039;ve included some pics below! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739762\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739764\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739767\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739770\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739772\/width\/467\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739778\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739780\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]stella331[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Curious about the locations you choose:) Where are you ladies having your welcome cocktail party? Cocktail hour? Reception?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1586958,"PostDate":1330203747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Stella!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We had our welcome party at Agave, Cocktail hour on the pier (amazing) and reception on the balcony off the side of the lobby! I've included some pics below!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"RedIbyChelsea\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739762\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"RedIbyChelsea\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739764\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"RedIbyChelsea\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739767\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"RedIbyChelsea\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739770\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"RedIbyChelsea\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739772\/width\/467\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"RedIbyChelsea\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739778\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"RedIbyChelsea\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/739780\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>stella331<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Curious about the locations you choose:) Where are you ladies having your welcome cocktail party? Cocktail hour? Reception?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245223537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1183,"TotalPages":119,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":1180},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
