Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4428fc8a68c90acae1bed5f01ab67cae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies i am knew to posting, mostly just reading and seeing all the great ideas on here&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I finally got my STD&#039;s back and will be mailing those out this week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Our date has been confirmed, Nov 30, 2012!&amp;nbsp; Very excited!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Does anyone know about how much they charge for welcome dinners?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1587532,"PostDate":1330367092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies i am knew to posting, mostly just reading and seeing all the great ideas on here<\/p> <p> I finally got my STD's back and will be mailing those out this week.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Our date has been confirmed, Nov 30, 2012!\u00a0 Very excited!<\/p> <p> Does anyone know about how much they charge for welcome dinners?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c1otoole@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1319603537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247083.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tiners17","Id":247083,"Name":"Tiners17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f803e119006f66a6a6ed83430fa1db3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; * new not knew   oops.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1587533,"PostDate":1330367156,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> * new not knew\u00a0\u00a0 oops.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c1otoole@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1319603537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247083.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tiners17","Id":247083,"Name":"Tiners17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d149f8b1b72874b04c64a5e6c00c6d34","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Bunny bride it looks like we have chosen the same places:) (well I think lol) it&#039;s so hard to choose without being there!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1588548,"PostDate":1330551584,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Bunny bride it looks like we have chosen the same places:) (well I think lol) it's so hard to choose without being there!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309491991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eec9575da68cbaf7302e227ead21aa66","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just found out that Nayeli is no longer doing weddings.&amp;nbsp; She got a promotion and is&amp;nbsp;working with all of the excellence resorts.&amp;nbsp; I am freaking out just a tad because now we have Gloria.&amp;nbsp; There wasn&#039;t an email introducing her to me or anything like that. I emailed Nayeli a question and Gloria responded. I had to ask her&amp;nbsp;why Nayeli was.&amp;nbsp; For those&amp;nbsp;of you who&amp;nbsp;have Gloria, is she good? My wedding is 2 months to the day TODAY.&amp;nbsp; She said she has all my information and not to worry, but how can I not?&amp;nbsp; I would be more easy-going about this if someone had just emailed me and told me.  Also, for those of you who have&amp;nbsp;Nayeli, did you get Gloria?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1591804,"PostDate":1331172544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just found out that Nayeli is no longer doing weddings.\u00a0 She got a promotion and is\u00a0working with all of the excellence resorts.\u00a0 I am freaking out just a tad because now we have Gloria.\u00a0 There wasn't an email introducing her to me or anything like that. I emailed Nayeli a question and Gloria responded. I had to ask her\u00a0why Nayeli was.\u00a0 For those\u00a0of you who\u00a0have Gloria, is she good? My wedding is 2 months to the day TODAY.\u00a0 She said she has all my information and not to worry, but how can I not?\u00a0 I would be more easy-going about this if someone had just emailed me and told me.\u00a0\u00a0Also, for those of you who have\u00a0Nayeli, did you get Gloria?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyc531@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309290733,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241691.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BunnyBride","Id":241691,"Name":"BunnyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2eec844acb65c408ba55d5b82f601b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; BunnyBride - I have been working with Gloria from the start and she has been wonderful. I know it&#039;s hard not to worry, since Nayeli was handling your wedding initially - but seriously Gloria has been great!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; On a side note, I just saw your post about OOT bags and stuff you&#039;ve gotten so far. Where did you get your chair sashes? I would rather buy some and bring them down as opposed to paying for them down there. Another thing...I didn&#039;t even think about customs confiscating the Gatorade packets, advil\/pepto\/etc!!! I hope that doesn&#039;t happen because that would totally ruin the bags :( ok maybe that&#039;s a little dramatic but it would really suck!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1591856,"PostDate":1331176357,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> BunnyBride - I have been working with Gloria from the start and she has been wonderful. I know it's hard not to worry, since Nayeli was handling your wedding initially - but seriously Gloria has been great!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> On a side note, I just saw your post about OOT bags and stuff you've gotten so far. Where did you get your chair sashes? I would rather buy some and bring them down as opposed to paying for them down there. Another thing...I didn't even think about customs confiscating the Gatorade packets, advil\/pepto\/etc!!! I hope that doesn't happen because that would totally ruin the bags <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> ok maybe that's a little dramatic but it would really suck!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb83e4f37b53c823fd4ff03a9742910a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; SunsetLove-Thank you for telling me about Gloria. Im sure it will be fine-just very nerve wracking.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got my chair sashes at &lt;a class=\"colors_homepage_title\" href=\"http:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com\/default.asp\" id=\"homepage_title\" title=\"www.tableclothsfactory.com\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"#0066cc\"&gt;www.tableclothsfactory.com&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; I paid something like 69 cent per sash.  If you&amp;nbsp;buy them at the resort, I thought nayeli said they were $5&amp;nbsp;per sash-which is INSANE.&amp;nbsp; I bought the satin sashes and really like them.&amp;nbsp; If you do buy them, just remmeber to take them out of their plastic packaging as the read &#039;made in china&#039; and they might be taken from you.  I really like the colors-I was&amp;nbsp;alittle scared of what color they really would be. I got the fuschia and light orange.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Regarding the OTT bag contents-I was thinking of sending down 2 packages to the resort.&amp;nbsp; One with the chair sashes, cocktail napkins, fans, and other non-food\/medicine related items.&amp;nbsp; The second with all the gatorade and pepto, etc.&amp;nbsp; Not sure yet if I will do it. It is VERY upsetting to think that anything I send will not make it and be stuck in customs!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1591898,"PostDate":1331180906,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> SunsetLove-Thank you for telling me about Gloria. Im sure it will be fine-just very nerve wracking.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got my chair sashes at <a href='http:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com\/default.asp' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><font color=\"#0066cc\">www.tableclothsfactory.com<\/font><\/a>.\u00a0 I paid something like 69 cent per sash.\u00a0\u00a0If you\u00a0buy them at the resort, I thought nayeli said they were $5\u00a0per sash-which is INSANE.\u00a0 I bought the satin sashes and really like them.\u00a0 If you do buy them, just remmeber to take them out of their plastic packaging as the read 'made in china' and they might be taken from you.\u00a0\u00a0I really like the colors-I was\u00a0alittle scared of what color they really would be. I got the fuschia and light orange.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Regarding the OTT bag contents-I was thinking of sending down 2 packages to the resort.\u00a0 One with the chair sashes, cocktail napkins, fans, and other non-food\/medicine related items.\u00a0 The second with all the gatorade and pepto, etc.\u00a0 Not sure yet if I will do it. It is VERY upsetting to think that anything I send will not make it and be stuck in customs!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyc531@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309290733,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241691.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BunnyBride","Id":241691,"Name":"BunnyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb58c6951eeb64e26887dc2c5c0c9793","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you! I will definitely have to check out that website! If you do send down a couple packages, let me know how it turns out because I may do the same. I am in the same boat as you...I don&#039;t want to spend all this money and put the effort into the OOT bags only to have half of it stuck in customs :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592062,"PostDate":1331228163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you! I will definitely have to check out that website! If you do send down a couple packages, let me know how it turns out because I may do the same. I am in the same boat as you...I don't want to spend all this money and put the effort into the OOT bags only to have half of it stuck in customs <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"314d831785764b8ba980565e0fab183d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I will definately let you know what happens.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m going to do alittle research before I send them. I might call Fed Ex and ask them and go on state travel website and see if I can get any info.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592781,"PostDate":1331337668,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I will definately let you know what happens.\u00a0 I'm going to do alittle research before I send them. I might call Fed Ex and ask them and go on state travel website and see if I can get any info.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyc531@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309290733,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241691.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BunnyBride","Id":241691,"Name":"BunnyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35350589ed814e2cd40b96443ee43c00","RawContent":"I&#039;ve had Gloria as a coordinator and I love her. She answers me within a day and is extremely helpful. Bunnybride just a question. What made you choose satin instead of organza? I&#039;m having a tought time deciding which I like best.","Attachments":[],"Id":1593381,"PostDate":1331522102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've had Gloria as a coordinator and I love her. She answers me within a day and is extremely helpful. Bunnybride just a question. What made you choose satin instead of organza? I'm having a tought time deciding which I like best.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309491991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1f161d4e459b7a4a46bc932d03e526a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; stella331-I actually saw someone&#039;s (can&#039;t remember her name) wedding photos on here and she got married at Excellence Cancun.&amp;nbsp; Her colors were the same as mine (fuschia and orange) and she used satin sashes and I saw it (she used satin) and said \"that&#039;s what my wedding is going to look like\".&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So far Gloria has answered all my questions very quickly, but I just don&#039;t feel the warmth that I did with Nayeli.&amp;nbsp; She is probably overwhelmed right now taking over, what I would think, be all of the weddings there. Or maybe it&#039;s just her personality? I do feel better that people have told me they have her and like her. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1593408,"PostDate":1331526819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> stella331-I actually saw someone's (can't remember her name) wedding photos on here and she got married at Excellence Cancun.\u00a0 Her colors were the same as mine (fuschia and orange) and she used satin sashes and I saw it (she used satin) and said \"that's what my wedding is going to look like\".<\/p> <p> So far Gloria has answered all my questions very quickly, but I just don't feel the warmth that I did with Nayeli.\u00a0 She is probably overwhelmed right now taking over, what I would think, be all of the weddings there. Or maybe it's just her personality? I do feel better that people have told me they have her and like her. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyc531@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309290733,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241691.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BunnyBride","Id":241691,"Name":"BunnyBride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1183,"TotalPages":119,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":1180},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
