> User kathryn78 (272662)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7803eab363438105453dfdead9e42229","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I had to jump on here to see what was going on at ERC. I am getting married at Excellence Playa Mujeres on May 19th and after 4, yes 4 wedding planners in the last year and a half,&amp;nbsp;just got Nayeli...I LOVE her! Some of the brides on the EPM thread are still being shuffled around&amp;nbsp;so I wanted to see if the same thing was happening here. Sounds like EPM needed Nayeli!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What a great idea about the chair sashes! I&amp;nbsp;had decided against them due to cost,&amp;nbsp;but&amp;nbsp;I need to rethink that if we can bring them into the resort!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also in the same boat about my OOT bag stash...bottles of Excedrin, tums, Imodium etc. I&#039;m sucking it up and getting the sparklers at the resort because of the possible&amp;nbsp;\"contraband\" situation at the airport, but&amp;nbsp;didn&#039;t even think about the meds! Just an FYI&amp;nbsp;for time purposes&amp;nbsp;if anyone is thinking of sending a package...We had sent an invitation down to show them our colors, and it took a month to get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congratulations and happy planning to all of you!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sheryl&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1594145,"PostDate":1331664211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies!<\/p> <p> I had to jump on here to see what was going on at ERC. I am getting married at Excellence Playa Mujeres on May 19th and after 4, yes 4 wedding planners in the last year and a half,\u00a0just got Nayeli...I LOVE her! Some of the brides on the EPM thread are still being shuffled around\u00a0so I wanted to see if the same thing was happening here. Sounds like EPM needed Nayeli!<\/p> <p> What a great idea about the chair sashes! I\u00a0had decided against them due to cost,\u00a0but\u00a0I need to rethink that if we can bring them into the resort!<\/p> <p> Also in the same boat about my OOT bag stash...bottles of Excedrin, tums, Imodium etc. I'm sucking it up and getting the sparklers at the resort because of the possible\u00a0\"contraband\" situation at the airport, but\u00a0didn't even think about the meds! Just an FYI\u00a0for time purposes\u00a0if anyone is thinking of sending a package...We had sent an invitation down to show them our colors, and it took a month to get there.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Congratulations and happy planning to all of you!!<\/p> <p> Sheryl<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sheryl_monaghan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1327287477,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250350.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"May12","Id":250350,"Name":"May12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6e94a35be65fcfffd389c105918f10c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m actually celebrating my honeymoon at the Excellence Riviera Cancun - immediately following my wedding, which is taking place in just a few short weeks at the gorgeous new Paradisus La Perla \/ La Esmeralda in Playe del Carmen.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For those of you who have already been to the resort, anything you can share?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks so much!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Inna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1594157,"PostDate":1331665024,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm actually celebrating my honeymoon at the Excellence Riviera Cancun - immediately following my wedding, which is taking place in just a few short weeks at the gorgeous new Paradisus La Perla \/ La Esmeralda in Playe del Carmen.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For those of you who have already been to the resort, anything you can share?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks so much!!!<\/p> <p> Inna<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"inna_daniel@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1316497374,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245572.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"InnaDaniel","Id":245572,"Name":"InnaDaniel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5c0f4a1cb405cec0a7a2ac76c3eb951","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just ordered samples of the sashes from https:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com and got free shipping! I just don&#039;t know what colors to do so I ordered a couple different ones. If any of you ladies are interested, I would suggest ordering asap because free shipping ends today. I&#039;m so excited...now I just have to wait 7-14 days for them to come :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1594318,"PostDate":1331679136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just ordered samples of the sashes from <a href='https:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com<\/a> and got free shipping! I just don't know what colors to do so I ordered a couple different ones. If any of you ladies are interested, I would suggest ordering asap because free shipping ends today. I'm so excited...now I just have to wait 7-14 days for them to come <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c77666a1272166323a828250246d825","RawContent":"Sunset love let me know how the samples are...I&#039;m going to be ordering from there as soon as I decide between organza or satin!","Attachments":[],"Id":1594525,"PostDate":1331699976,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sunset love let me know how the samples are...I'm going to be ordering from there as soon as I decide between organza or satin!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309491991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d3b90dd5164e3640b59ca020f3e2604","RawContent":"ok, second try to post... \n \n Regarding sending packages-I emailed Gloria and she gave me an email address of someone who they work with to help with items being shipped into Mexico.  The company is called CICSA Logistics Solutions.  have you heard of them? They have warehouse in the US and you would ship your package there and then they would take over and ship it down to mexico.  You have to fill out a form of what you&#039;re sending and they will give you a quote.  I dont know if Im going to do this.  When nayeli was my coordinator she said to use fed ex. maybe I am looking too much into sending packages vs bringing them on the plane?  I don&#039;t know.  Just stressed about it! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]SunsetLove[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n BunnyBride - I have been working with Gloria from the start and she has been wonderful. I know it&#039;s hard not to worry, since Nayeli was handling your wedding initially - but seriously Gloria has been great! \n \n On a side note, I just saw your post about OOT bags and stuff you&#039;ve gotten so far. Where did you get your chair sashes? I would rather buy some and bring them down as opposed to paying for them down there. Another thing...I didn&#039;t even think about customs confiscating the Gatorade packets, advil\/pepto\/etc!!! I hope that doesn&#039;t happen because that would totally ruin the bags :( ok maybe that&#039;s a little dramatic but it would really suck!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1595132,"PostDate":1331774718,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> ok, second try to post...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Regarding sending packages-I emailed Gloria and she gave me an email address of someone who they work with to help with items being shipped into Mexico.\u00a0 The company is called CICSA Logistics Solutions.\u00a0 have you heard of them? They have warehouse in the US and you would ship your package there and then they would take over and ship it down to mexico.\u00a0 You have to fill out a form of what you're sending and they will give you a quote.\u00a0 I dont know if Im going to do this.\u00a0 When nayeli was my coordinator she said to use fed ex. maybe I am looking too much into sending packages vs bringing them on the plane?\u00a0 I don't know.\u00a0 Just stressed about it!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>SunsetLove<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> BunnyBride - I have been working with Gloria from the start and she has been wonderful. I know it's hard not to worry, since Nayeli was handling your wedding initially - but seriously Gloria has been great!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> On a side note, I just saw your post about OOT bags and stuff you've gotten so far. Where did you get your chair sashes? I would rather buy some and bring them down as opposed to paying for them down there. Another thing...I didn't even think about customs confiscating the Gatorade packets, advil\/pepto\/etc!!! I hope that doesn't happen because that would totally ruin the bags <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> ok maybe that's a little dramatic but it would really suck!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyc531@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309290733,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241691.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BunnyBride","Id":241691,"Name":"BunnyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9f413a9bf371b92cb33d9933cfb35ec","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]stella331[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Sunset love let me know how the samples are...I&#039;m going to be ordering from there as soon as I decide between organza or satin![\/quote] \n \n Stella, I will definitely let you know...I can&#039;t wait for them to come in!! \n \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]BunnyBride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n ok, second try to post... \n \n Regarding sending packages-I emailed Gloria and she gave me an email address of someone who they work with to help with items being shipped into Mexico.  The company is called CICSA Logistics Solutions.  have you heard of them? They have warehouse in the US and you would ship your package there and then they would take over and ship it down to mexico.  You have to fill out a form of what you&#039;re sending and they will give you a quote.  I dont know if Im going to do this.  When nayeli was my coordinator she said to use fed ex. maybe I am looking too much into sending packages vs bringing them on the plane?  I don&#039;t know.  Just stressed about it! \n \n \n[\/quote] \n \n Bunny, decisions decisions!! I don&#039;t know...I may just put my stuff in one of my checked bags. I&#039;m wondering how often people get stuff confiscated like that? Also, I wonder if the meds\/gatorade packets were put inside of something else like a first aid kit or something...maybe they would overlook them? Man, I just don&#039;t know what to do either!","Attachments":[],"Id":1595506,"PostDate":1331845662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>stella331<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Sunset love let me know how the samples are...I'm going to be ordering from there as soon as I decide between organza or satin!<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Stella, I will definitely let you know...I can't wait for them to come in!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>BunnyBride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> ok, second try to post...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Regarding sending packages-I emailed Gloria and she gave me an email address of someone who they work with to help with items being shipped into Mexico.\u00a0 The company is called CICSA Logistics Solutions.\u00a0 have you heard of them? They have warehouse in the US and you would ship your package there and then they would take over and ship it down to mexico.\u00a0 You have to fill out a form of what you're sending and they will give you a quote.\u00a0 I dont know if Im going to do this.\u00a0 When nayeli was my coordinator she said to use fed ex. maybe I am looking too much into sending packages vs bringing them on the plane?\u00a0 I don't know.\u00a0 Just stressed about it!<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Bunny, decisions decisions!! I don't know...I may just put my stuff in one of my checked bags. I'm wondering how often people get stuff confiscated like that? Also, I wonder if the meds\/gatorade packets were put inside of something else like a first aid kit or something...maybe they would overlook them? Man, I just don't know what to do either!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62a3f3781c4874567109c7e16ef4c9f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Bunny Bride, I don&#039;t know if you have seen the posts in the OOT Bag section of the forums, but there was someone posting today about OTC medications for OOT bags and it sounds like if it&#039;s in it&#039;s original packaging they will not confiscate it. At least that is what I gathered...Yipee! I just ordered my meds today from http:\/\/www.first-aid-product.com\/ SUPER CHEAP!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596719,"PostDate":1332195907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Bunny Bride, I don't know if you have seen the posts in the OOT Bag section of the forums, but there was someone posting today about OTC medications for OOT bags and it sounds like if it's in it's original packaging they will not confiscate it. At least that is what I gathered...Yipee! I just ordered my meds today from <a href='http:\/\/www.first-aid-product.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.first-aid-product.com\/<\/a> SUPER CHEAP!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bad322dd71a1574bd1054f33b34eef27","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Oh and by the way, if you were wanting to order anything from Oriential Trading for your wedding\/OOT bags - today is the day! Free shipping plus a $10 gift card for orders over $59! I just ordered my raffia fans, maracas, votive holders, decks of flip flop playing cards, and the coil keychains for my keycard\/tip holders!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596722,"PostDate":1332196061,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Oh and by the way, if you were wanting to order anything from Oriential Trading for your wedding\/OOT bags - today is the day! Free shipping plus a $10 gift card for orders over $59! I just ordered my raffia fans, maracas, votive holders, decks of flip flop playing cards, and the coil keychains for my keycard\/tip holders!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"750523ede0531f5f87d0484f633d750b","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]SunsetLove[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Bunny Bride, I don&#039;t know if you have seen the posts in the OOT Bag section of the forums, but there was someone posting today about OTC medications for OOT bags and it sounds like if it&#039;s in it&#039;s original packaging they will not confiscate it. At least that is what I gathered...Yipee! I just ordered my meds today from [url=\"http:\/\/www.first-aid-product.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.first-aid-product.com\/[\/url] SUPER CHEAP![\/quote] \n \n \n sunsetlove-thank you so much for sharing the website for the meds!!! they really are super cheap!! \n \n I was going to make my own first aid kit, but now I have decided just to buy some already pre-made ones and then add more motrin, advil, etc.  I mean, with all-inclusive, I KNOW that my friends will be needing more than 2 tablets of advil for the whole trip.  I am getting them at [url=\"http:\/\/www.navyandlavender.com\/product\/tote_rescue_me_kit\/\"]http:\/\/www.navyandlavender.com\/product\/tote_rescue_me_kit\/[\/url]. I haven&#039;t bought them yet, as I just found out today that one more pseron is going! Thank GOD when I ordered other items, I ordered up in case of people deciding last minute.   I think I might wait 2 weeks until I order them.","Attachments":[],"Id":1596744,"PostDate":1332199914,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>SunsetLove<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Bunny Bride, I don't know if you have seen the posts in the OOT Bag section of the forums, but there was someone posting today about OTC medications for OOT bags and it sounds like if it's in it's original packaging they will not confiscate it. At least that is what I gathered...Yipee! I just ordered my meds today from http:\/\/www.first-aid-product.com\/ SUPER CHEAP!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> sunsetlove-thank you so much for sharing the website for the meds!!! they really are super cheap!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was going to make my own first aid kit, but now I have decided just to buy some already pre-made ones and then add more motrin, advil, etc.\u00a0 I mean, with all-inclusive, I KNOW that my friends will be needing more than 2 tablets of advil for the whole trip.\u00a0 I am getting them at <a href='http:\/\/www.navyandlavender.com\/product\/tote_rescue_me_kit\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.navyandla..._rescue_me_kit\/<\/a>. I haven't bought them yet, as I just found out today that one more pseron is going!\u00a0Thank GOD when I ordered other items, I ordered up in case of people deciding last minute.\u00a0 \u00a0I think I might wait 2 weeks until I order them.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyc531@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1309290733,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241691.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BunnyBride","Id":241691,"Name":"BunnyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1afdbff94ced7baaa7ce239db952b180","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; hi girls !!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; i am getting married at ERC 6\/11\/12 ... i love nayeli and i am sorry for the ones who dont have her as a wedding planner anymore .. I have met with her many of times and we just click so well , trust me no matter who you have your weddings are going to be amazing&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; what colors is everyone doing ??&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; i just bought welcome bags and have been filling them with alot of things , does anyone have any ideas to put inside a welcome bag?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1598037,"PostDate":1332432423,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> hi girls !!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> i am getting married at ERC 6\/11\/12 ... i love nayeli and i am sorry for the ones who dont have her as a wedding planner anymore .. I have met with her many of times and we just click so well , trust me no matter who you have your weddings are going to be amazing<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> what colors is everyone doing ??\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> i just bought welcome bags and have been filling them with alot of things , does anyone have any ideas to put inside a welcome bag?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gettingmarried143@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1306171899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"traveltoni","Id":240311,"Name":"traveltoni","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1183,"TotalPages":119,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":1180},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
