Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3209feb176a8cec0d0a107a7627bdad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m also having Elegance do my hair and makeup!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m a little worried, but we&#039;ll see :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1402962,"PostDate":1298336035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm also having Elegance do my hair and makeup!\u00a0 I'm a little worried, but we'll see <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jamie.cossetti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294662536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235335.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jamie0820","Id":235335,"Name":"jamie0820","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b9ae1ace05f5204bfce293917c23a86","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m hoping to have my hair done at the Colonial. My bridesmaids were interested as well, but for nearly $90 US that is crazy expensive. I can get my wedding hair done in Canada at some top salons for less than that :(&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Very disappointed with the price. Hope the quality of my hair style makes up for it.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1434607,"PostDate":1302791349,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm hoping to have my hair done at the Colonial. My bridesmaids were interested as well, but for nearly $90 US that is crazy expensive. I can get my wedding hair done in Canada at some top salons for less than that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Very disappointed with the price. Hope the quality of my hair style makes up for it.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aaronlori@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1301141382,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238189.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aaronlori","Id":238189,"Name":"aaronlori","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6b845ea8e22de3b663ab213c99f5f09","RawContent":"Same here!! I couldn&#039;t believe the prices they are charging for hairstyles... thanksfully My resort is like 2 minutes from their plazas, I was able to meet with the owner of one of the hair salons outside of the resort and she is doing our hairstyles for $25...which is pretty awesome I brought her pics and got to see their work.. u should look into exploring outside of your resort as an option.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]aaronlori[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;m hoping to have my hair done at the Colonial. My bridesmaids were interested as well, but for nearly $90 US that is crazy expensive. I can get my wedding hair done in Canada at some top salons for less than that :( \n \n Very disappointed with the price. Hope the quality of my hair style makes up for it.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1434835,"PostDate":1302812007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Same here!! I couldn't believe the prices they are charging for hairstyles... thanksfully My resort is like 2 minutes from their plazas, I was able to meet with the owner of one of the hair salons outside of the resort and she is doing our hairstyles for $25...which is pretty awesome I brought her pics and got to see their work.. u should look into exploring outside of your resort as an option.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>aaronlori<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I'm hoping to have my hair done at the Colonial. My bridesmaids were interested as well, but for nearly $90 US that is crazy expensive. I can get my wedding hair done in Canada at some top salons for less than that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Very disappointed with the price. Hope the quality of my hair style makes up for it.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em><strong>11.12.2011 \"Living for the Love of you\" Paradisus Punta Cana<\/strong><\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bethaniadz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247117196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219238.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Miss Sunshyne","Id":219238,"Name":"Miss Sunshyne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e1445bba922d7b7abd6550e6e5d9d15","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am using &lt;span class=\"c_ic_name\" id=\"rmic1_name\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"#2a2a2a\" size=\"3\"&gt;Spa-Med Punta Cana Palmarosa.&amp;nbsp; I have been communicating with Carole there.&amp;nbsp; She has been very prompt.&amp;nbsp; $60 for bride hair and %25 for bridesmaids.&amp;nbsp; I am going to her the day before the wedding for a trial, and day of the wedding she will be coming to my resort and doing our hair there.&amp;nbsp; I originally wanted my hair half up, but I&#039;m worried about how it will hold up with the weather, so I am trying to find an up do that I love just incase my hair does not cooperate!&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"c_shad\" style=\"position: absolute; filter: alpha(opacity=20); background-color: #000; width: 243px; display: none; height: 98px; visibility: hidden; top: 28px; left: 12px\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"display: none\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1435219,"PostDate":1302876528,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am using <span class=\"c_ic_name\" id=\"rmic1_name\"><font color=\"#2a2a2a\" size=\"3\">Spa-Med Punta Cana Palmarosa.\u00a0 I have been communicating with Carole there.\u00a0 She has been very prompt.\u00a0 $60 for bride hair and %25 for bridesmaids.\u00a0 I am going to her the day before the wedding for a trial, and day of the wedding she will be coming to my resort and doing our hair there.\u00a0 I originally wanted my hair half up, but I'm worried about how it will hold up with the weather, so I am trying to find an up do that I love just incase my hair does not cooperate!<\/font><\/span><\/p> <div class=\"c_shad\"  style=\"background-color: #000;display: none\"> \u00a0<\/div> <p> <span  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robertsonv@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282663861,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231675.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kryzaniwsky","Id":231675,"Name":"kryzaniwsky","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13dc61a6b72c6b345eed7e81798565f1","RawContent":"Make sure your resort won&#039;t charge you a day pass for the stylist to come do your hair, my resort tried saying that to me which was ridiculous $95 I said no thanks I will go to them.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kryzaniwsky[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I am using [size=3][color=#2a2a2a]Spa-Med Punta Cana Palmarosa.  I have been communicating with Carole there.  She has been very prompt.  $60 for bride hair and %25 for bridesmaids.  I am going to her the day before the wedding for a trial, and day of the wedding she will be coming to my resort and doing our hair there.  I originally wanted my hair half up, but I&#039;m worried about how it will hold up with the weather, so I am trying to find an up do that I love just incase my hair does not cooperate![\/color][\/size] \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1437173,"PostDate":1303242060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Make sure your resort won't charge you a day pass for the stylist to come do your hair, my resort tried saying that to me which was ridiculous $95 I said no thanks I will go to them.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kryzaniwsky<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I am using <span class=\"c_ic_name\" id=\"rmic1_name\"><font color=\"#2a2a2a\" size=\"3\">Spa-Med Punta Cana Palmarosa.\u00a0 I have been communicating with Carole there.\u00a0 She has been very prompt.\u00a0 $60 for bride hair and %25 for bridesmaids.\u00a0 I am going to her the day before the wedding for a trial, and day of the wedding she will be coming to my resort and doing our hair there.\u00a0 I originally wanted my hair half up, but I'm worried about how it will hold up with the weather, so I am trying to find an up do that I love just incase my hair does not cooperate!<\/font><\/span><\/p> <div class=\"c_shad\"  style=\"display: none;background-color: #000\"> \u00a0<\/div> <p> <span  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em><strong>11.12.2011 \"Living for the Love of you\" Paradisus Punta Cana<\/strong><\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bethaniadz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247117196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219238.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Miss Sunshyne","Id":219238,"Name":"Miss Sunshyne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"145cc17bb278c96dc6818b4d989e3174","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Miss Sunshyne, would you mind telling me which outside vendor you are using to come and do your makeup? I am really nervous about this and I wanted a &#039;professional&#039; to do my makeup and not have to just take lessons. I would really appreciate it. I&#039;m getting married in less than a month.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1444047,"PostDate":1304233499,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Miss Sunshyne, would you mind telling me which outside vendor you are using to come and do your makeup? I am really nervous about this and I wanted a 'professional' to do my makeup and not have to just take lessons. I would really appreciate it. I'm getting married in less than a month.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krystalkelley12@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1296074137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"KrystalKelley","Id":236038,"Name":"KrystalKelley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83f08557fbcafb7b93551053617c506f","RawContent":"I replied to your PM :)\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KrystalKelley[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Miss Sunshyne, would you mind telling me which outside vendor you are using to come and do your makeup? I am really nervous about this and I wanted a &#039;professional&#039; to do my makeup and not have to just take lessons. I would really appreciate it. I&#039;m getting married in less than a month.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1446067,"PostDate":1304523478,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I replied to your PM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KrystalKelley<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Miss Sunshyne, would you mind telling me which outside vendor you are using to come and do your makeup? I am really nervous about this and I wanted a 'professional' to do my makeup and not have to just take lessons. I would really appreciate it. I'm getting married in less than a month.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em><strong>11.12.2011 \"Living for the Love of you\" Paradisus Punta Cana<\/strong><\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bethaniadz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247117196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219238.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Miss Sunshyne","Id":219238,"Name":"Miss Sunshyne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4da7ffffb9887a373984dc6953c0acb6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was married at the Paradisus Palma Real in Punta Cana on April 18th. I can tell you that I didn&#039;t love my hair (had to tweak it - I asked for a side, low messy chignon and I got 80&#039;s prom spiral curals) and I HATED HATED HATED my makeup that the spa \/ salon did for me. BUT I was prepared. I went to MAC and took a picture of what I liked with me and had one of their artists show me how, I bought all the products. As soon as I got back to my room after my makeup was done on my wedding day, I washed my face and just did it again. It didn&#039;t take long.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I would HIGHLY recommend that you come prepared....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1446089,"PostDate":1304525196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was married at the Paradisus Palma Real in Punta Cana on April 18th. I can tell you that I didn't love my hair (had to tweak it - I asked for a side, low messy chignon and I got 80's prom spiral curals) and I HATED HATED HATED my makeup that the spa \/ salon did for me. BUT I was prepared. I went to MAC and took a picture of what I liked with me and had one of their artists show me how, I bought all the products. As soon as I got back to my room after my makeup was done on my wedding day, I washed my face and just did it again. It didn't take long.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would HIGHLY recommend that you come prepared....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elese.t.m.l@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1297826304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236844.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lesee","Id":236844,"Name":"lesee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca54308b84ac71c9db2cd5da4004b733","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Miss SunShyne...for whatever reason I didn&#039;t get the private message :( would you mind sending it again. Sorry!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1446326,"PostDate":1304541317,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Miss SunShyne...for whatever reason I didn't get the private message <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> would you mind sending it again. Sorry!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krystalkelley12@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1296074137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"KrystalKelley","Id":236038,"Name":"KrystalKelley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c73b146be7cccaf76f6e8ff90aec872","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Does anyone have any recommendations for salons OFF the resort for hair\/makeup?! I wouldnt mind going to the mall or something to get it done in the am.... Manicures too. After 4 days in the sand, i&#039;m going to need a new pedi!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1450885,"PostDate":1305252243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Does anyone have any recommendations for salons OFF the resort for hair\/makeup?! I wouldnt mind going to the mall or something to get it done in the am.... Manicures too. After 4 days in the sand, i'm going to need a new pedi!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mhagmaye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305249784,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239949.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chelle2BMorrell","Id":239949,"Name":"Chelle2BMorrell","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
