{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"291db0152b3fdde04979b3aef8e8257e","RawContent":"Hi Miss Sunshyne! Can you tell me the name of the salon where you are getting your hair done at is called? I am getting married in January and am looking for options other than the resort for my hair. Thanks! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Miss Sunshyne[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Since I&#039;ve already been to Paradisus Punta Cana, I know the area, I will be doing my hair outside of the resort in one of the plazas, The spa in the resort charges $90+ for a hair style where I pay $50 max in NY, the outside hair salons in PC charge $25, which is great!, I already went saw their work and showed them what I was looking for. \n \n In regards to my makeup, I&#039;m getting a professional artist from the capital to come and do everyone&#039;s makeup, she charges $80 for brides, $50 for bridesmaids plus transportation. Makeup means alot to me, it always reflects in pictures, I think I would be stressed doing it myself.... I need to relax in the moments leading up to the ceremony.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1483169,"PostDate":1310144093,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> Hi Miss Sunshyne! Can you tell me the name of the salon where you are getting your hair done at is called? I am getting married in January and am looking for options\u00a0other than the resort for my hair. Thanks!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Miss Sunshyne<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Since I've already been to Paradisus Punta Cana, I know the area, I will be doing my hair outside of the resort in one of the plazas, The spa in the resort charges $90+ for a hair style where I pay $50 max in NY, the outside hair salons in PC charge $25, which is great!, I already went saw their work and showed them what I was looking for.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> In regards to my makeup, I'm getting a professional artist from the capital to come and do everyone's makeup, she charges $80 for brides, $50 for bridesmaids plus transportation. Makeup means alot to me, it always reflects in pictures, I think I would be stressed doing it myself.... I need to relax in the moments leading up to the ceremony.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"d_sorvig@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297651891,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236764.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danz","Id":236764,"Name":"Danz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5598287262959ba3785890764016c229","RawContent":"The hair salon is called Sandra&#039;s... I have the business card at home. I will give you all the info tonight. They&#039;re very friendly, they only speak spanish though but I&#039;m sure with pictures that you bring or you can look at their portfolio and all should be fine, they even pick you up and drop you off. The salon is average size with 4 hair dressers, pretty nice considering... (not a whole in the wall) she charges $25 for hairstyles which is great!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Danz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n Hi Miss Sunshyne! Can you tell me the name of the salon where you are getting your hair done at is called? I am getting married in January and am looking for options other than the resort for my hair. Thanks! \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1484805,"PostDate":1310478298,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> The hair salon is called Sandra's... I have the business card at home. I will give you all the info tonight. They're very friendly, they only speak spanish though but I'm sure with pictures that you bring or you can look at their portfolio and all should be fine, they even pick you up and drop you off. The salon is average size with 4 hair dressers, pretty nice considering... (not a whole in the wall) she charges $25 for hairstyles which is great!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Danz<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> <br \/> Hi Miss Sunshyne! Can you tell me the name of the salon where you are getting your hair done at is called? I am getting married in January and am looking for options\u00a0other than the resort for my hair. Thanks!<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em><strong>11.12.2011 \"Living for the Love of you\" Paradisus Punta Cana<\/strong><\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bethaniadz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247117196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219238.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Miss Sunshyne","Id":219238,"Name":"Miss Sunshyne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"024e377529763c9a6bb60c389f47f8de","RawContent":"That would be awesome! Thanks so much! You will also have to let me know how it was after your wedding!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Miss Sunshyne[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n The hair salon is called Sandra&#039;s... I have the business card at home. I will give you all the info tonight. They&#039;re very friendly, they only speak spanish though but I&#039;m sure with pictures that you bring or you can look at their portfolio and all should be fine, they even pick you up and drop you off. The salon is average size with 4 hair dressers, pretty nice considering... (not a whole in the wall) she charges $25 for hairstyles which is great!\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1485128,"PostDate":1310501790,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> That would be awesome! Thanks so much! You will also have to let me know how it was after your wedding!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Miss Sunshyne<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> The hair salon is called Sandra's... I have the business card at home. I will give you all the info tonight. They're very friendly, they only speak spanish though but I'm sure with pictures that you bring or you can look at their portfolio and all should be fine, they even pick you up and drop you off. The salon is average size with 4 hair dressers, pretty nice considering... (not a whole in the wall) she charges $25 for hairstyles which is great!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"d_sorvig@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297651891,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236764.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danz","Id":236764,"Name":"Danz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"660e2518a1d9f6da4694908a42e3d4ba","RawContent":"Lesee- I&#039;m trying to figure out where to get my hair done... I&#039;m at PRR in Nov- and seriously considering the resort spa....  Who should i NOT go to?? :)  THANKS!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lesee[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Ladies \n \n I was married at the Paradisus Palma Real in Punta Cana on April 18th. I can tell you that I didn&#039;t love my hair (had to tweak it - I asked for a side, low messy chignon and I got 80&#039;s prom spiral curals) and I HATED HATED HATED my makeup that the spa \/ salon did for me. BUT I was prepared. I went to MAC and took a picture of what I liked with me and had one of their artists show me how, I bought all the products. As soon as I got back to my room after my makeup was done on my wedding day, I washed my face and just did it again. It didn&#039;t take long. \n \n I would HIGHLY recommend that you come prepared....[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1488897,"PostDate":1311117111,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Lesee- I'm trying to figure out where to get my hair done... I'm at PRR in Nov- and seriously considering the resort spa....\u00a0 Who should i NOT go to?? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 THANKS!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lesee<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ladies<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was married at the Paradisus Palma Real in Punta Cana on April 18th. I can tell you that I didn't love my hair (had to tweak it - I asked for a side, low messy chignon and I got 80's prom spiral curals) and I HATED HATED HATED my makeup that the spa \/ salon did for me. BUT I was prepared. I went to MAC and took a picture of what I liked with me and had one of their artists show me how, I bought all the products. As soon as I got back to my room after my makeup was done on my wedding day, I washed my face and just did it again. It didn't take long.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would HIGHLY recommend that you come prepared....<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mhagmaye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305249784,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239949.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chelle2BMorrell","Id":239949,"Name":"Chelle2BMorrell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1777bb91ab5f3d1f0b011d895c9a66ae","RawContent":"Hi Miss sunshine! Thanks for the info.  Can i have your POC for make-up?  How did you find her?  Did you have any photos of her work?!  \n \n Thanks! Michelle \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Miss Sunshyne[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Since I&#039;ve already been to Paradisus Punta Cana, I know the area, I will be doing my hair outside of the resort in one of the plazas, The spa in the resort charges $90+ for a hair style where I pay $50 max in NY, the outside hair salons in PC charge $25, which is great!, I already went saw their work and showed them what I was looking for. \n \n In regards to my makeup, I&#039;m getting a professional artist from the capital to come and do everyone&#039;s makeup, she charges $80 for brides, $50 for bridesmaids plus transportation. Makeup means alot to me, it always reflects in pictures, I think I would be stressed doing it myself.... I need to relax in the moments leading up to the ceremony.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1488901,"PostDate":1311117260,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Hi Miss sunshine! Thanks for the info.\u00a0 Can i have your POC for make-up?\u00a0 How did you find her?\u00a0 Did you have any photos of her work?!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks! Michelle<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Miss Sunshyne<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Since I've already been to Paradisus Punta Cana, I know the area, I will be doing my hair outside of the resort in one of the plazas, The spa in the resort charges $90+ for a hair style where I pay $50 max in NY, the outside hair salons in PC charge $25, which is great!, I already went saw their work and showed them what I was looking for.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> In regards to my makeup, I'm getting a professional artist from the capital to come and do everyone's makeup, she charges $80 for brides, $50 for bridesmaids plus transportation. Makeup means alot to me, it always reflects in pictures, I think I would be stressed doing it myself.... I need to relax in the moments leading up to the ceremony.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mhagmaye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305249784,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239949.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chelle2BMorrell","Id":239949,"Name":"Chelle2BMorrell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f219722882d93b8fe0529aa7e9c4ce7c","RawContent":"Sorry it took me so long to goet you the info. \n \n The Salon is called \"Sandra\" the owner&#039;s name is Sandra lol \n \n the address is Plaza Punta Cana Local No.55, Bavaro, Higuey, R.D. \n \n The phone # is 809-552-1398\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Danz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n That would be awesome! Thanks so much! You will also have to let me know how it was after your wedding!\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1489208,"PostDate":1311171774,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Sorry it took me so long to goet you the info.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The Salon is called \"Sandra\" the owner's name is Sandra lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> the address is Plaza Punta Cana Local No.55, Bavaro, Higuey, R.D.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The phone # is 809-552-1398<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Danz<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> That would be awesome! Thanks so much! You will also have to let me know how it was after your wedding!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em><strong>11.12.2011 \"Living for the Love of you\" Paradisus Punta Cana<\/strong><\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bethaniadz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247117196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219238.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Miss Sunshyne","Id":219238,"Name":"Miss Sunshyne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6b779fda5c441c88885809eabc48121","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_7_1310477190474114\"&gt; you can see some of her work here in this blog&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_7_1310477190474112\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; \n Hi Miss sunshine! Thanks for the info.&amp;nbsp; Can i have your POC for make-up?&amp;nbsp; How did you find her?&amp;nbsp; Did you have any photos of her work?!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks! Michelle&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/blockquote&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1489210,"PostDate":1311172071,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_7_1310477190474114\"> you can see some of her work here in this blog<\/p> <p id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_7_1310477190474112\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Hi Miss sunshine! Thanks for the info.\u00a0 Can i have your POC for make-up?\u00a0 How did you find her?\u00a0 Did you have any photos of her work?!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks! Michelle<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em><strong>11.12.2011 \"Living for the Love of you\" Paradisus Punta Cana<\/strong><\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bethaniadz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247117196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219238.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Miss Sunshyne","Id":219238,"Name":"Miss Sunshyne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1480e20d2d57cc337d1f900cce04045","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Miss Sunshyne, I was wondering who you hired to do your makeup?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1678596,"PostDate":1351171928,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Miss Sunshyne, I was wondering who you hired to do your makeup?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wangon3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1340233688,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256940.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WTunner","Id":256940,"Name":"WTunner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71de0ce8daf460b8a19b6c67cca9d72c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Miss Sunshyne[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n The hair salon is called Sandra&#039;s... I have the business card at home. I will give you all the info tonight. They&#039;re very friendly, they only speak spanish though but I&#039;m sure with pictures that you bring or you can look at their portfolio and all should be fine, they even pick you up and drop you off. The salon is average size with 4 hair dressers, pretty nice considering... (not a whole in the wall) she charges $25 for hairstyles which is great!\n   \n \n \n[\/quote] \n Does anybody have the information for this salon? I need to find a makeup and hairstylist in Punta Cana. \n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1772097,"PostDate":1372132464,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Miss Sunshyne<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> The hair salon is called Sandra's... I have the business card at home. I will give you all the info tonight. They're very friendly, they only speak spanish though but I'm sure with pictures that you bring or you can look at their portfolio and all should be fine, they even pick you up and drop you off. The salon is average size with 4 hair dressers, pretty nice considering... (not a whole in the wall) she charges $25 for hairstyles which is great!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Does anybody have the information for this salon? I need to find a makeup and hairstylist in Punta Cana.<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>I am excited to marry the most loving man I have ever met and to become part of his amazing family.<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"totorowtt@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"146.233.0.201","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1368399589,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269521.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe2014","Id":269521,"Name":"Bridetobe2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58413,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5a583bea560fd7b37fc0ef1d72efe0b","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Bridetobe2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;Does anybody have the information for this salon? I need to find a makeup and hairstylist in Punta Cana.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;You can try Anna Nuet. She has a facebook with pictures. I will be using her for my wedding in November.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1797964,"PostDate":1378424292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Bridetobe2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>Does anybody have the information for this salon? I need to find a makeup and hairstylist in Punta Cana.<\/p> <p>Thanks!<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>You can try Anna Nuet. She has a facebook with pictures. I will be using her for my wedding in November.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"madeline152003@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.100.18.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1351217364,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261785.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mady28","Id":261785,"Name":"Mady28","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
