> User Sps211 (282789)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":899,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":105012,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1373855,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":235366,"Name":"LovesJakeyPoo","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235366.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1294762937,"LastPoster":{"Id":277086,"Name":"gameeljary","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277086.jpg?_r=1394547091","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":147,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1373855,"PostDate":1294762937,"PostContent":"Hey ladies!  \u00a0  My fiance and i have been looking around online for the perfect resort for our s...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"way2radd4u@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.228.88.117","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294711966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235366.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LovesJakeyPoo","Id":235366,"Name":"LovesJakeyPoo","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2188c14f9c952589f64991de5335b598","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey ladies!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My fiance and i have been looking around online for the perfect resort for our special day and we ran across the hard rock! It looks really nice and the wedding packages seem like the best for the money that we have seen. We may have a larger group and the hotel seems large enough to accomodate out sometimes rowdy group. has anyone had any experiance with this resort? Also any other good hotels i should be aware of in the caribbean that would be good for a larger group (25-40 guests)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Was looking into sandals as well but they seem like they may be a little more pricey for our guests....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any help would be appreciated greatly!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1373855,"PostDate":1294762937,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey ladies!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My fiance and i have been looking around online for the perfect resort for our special day and we ran across the hard rock! It looks really nice and the wedding packages seem like the best for the money that we have seen. We may have a larger group and the hotel seems large enough to accomodate out sometimes rowdy group. has anyone had any experiance with this resort? Also any other good hotels i should be aware of in the caribbean that would be good for a larger group (25-40 guests)<\/p> <p> Was looking into sandals as well but they seem like they may be a little more pricey for our guests....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any help would be appreciated greatly!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"way2radd4u@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.228.88.117","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294711966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235366.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LovesJakeyPoo","Id":235366,"Name":"LovesJakeyPoo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ababdf50645080fa937a11874f21155","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Pics don&#039;t do it justice! We went on a tour with one of the WC there she was amazing, i&#039;ll have to look for her name... The facility is huge and will def accomidate your group.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s very trendy and has&amp;nbsp;many restaurants, activites&amp;nbsp;and the spa was phenominal.&amp;nbsp;If you have your wedding in one of the ballrooms you can have your event go later (for additional $).&amp;nbsp; The only con we found was the distance b\/t the main building,&amp;nbsp;beach and rooms, &amp;nbsp;a bit far from eachother depending on where you stood.&amp;nbsp; They have a tran car system that makes designated stops. I asked the WC if we were able to reserve it so our guests would arrive on time and not have to worry about walking far, we were told that&amp;nbsp;that wasn&#039;t avaialble.&amp;nbsp; Other than that we had a great time. Hope this helped a little..&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1375105,"PostDate":1294888208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Pics don't do it justice! We went on a tour with one of the WC there she was amazing, i'll have to look for her name... The facility is huge and will def accomidate your group.\u00a0 It's very trendy and has\u00a0many restaurants, activites\u00a0and the spa was phenominal.\u00a0If you have your wedding in one of the ballrooms you can have your event go later (for additional $).\u00a0 The only con we found was the distance b\/t the main building,\u00a0beach and rooms, \u00a0a bit far from eachother depending on where you stood.\u00a0 They have a tran car system that makes designated stops. I asked the WC if we were able to reserve it so our guests would arrive on time and not have to worry about walking far, we were told that\u00a0that wasn't avaialble.\u00a0 Other than that we had a great time. Hope this helped a little..\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janireh14@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1292199168,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234569.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jhern","Id":234569,"Name":"jhern","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8edd123e11ca1cd62dedf891bc32bc71","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It&#039;s so weird i&#039;ve been reading all these reviews about it, and the more i read the more i become confused =( I keep being drawn back to it though so something tells meeh i should just go for it. I don&#039;t wanna make a&amp;nbsp;rash decision though because this is a very important day. Been reading up on Dreams in punta cana as well seems a bit less pricey for guests but also doesnt look as fun&amp;nbsp;as HRH....Tavel Agent we were referred to doesn&#039;t know all that much about it either she was told it was a &amp;quot;concrete jungle&amp;quot; It just seems so our vibe where as all other resorts seem dull in comparison! We are not just limited to DR i was actually trying to stray away from DR due to language barrier and the fact that my fiance&#039;s buddy got married in DR a few years ago....but the HRH drew me in.....Do i listen to the reviews or my gut?! help!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1375884,"PostDate":1294976785,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It's so weird i've been reading all these reviews about it, and the more i read the more i become confused =( I keep being drawn back to it though so something tells meeh i should just go for it. I don't wanna make a\u00a0rash decision though because this is a very important day. Been reading up on Dreams in punta cana as well seems a bit less pricey for guests but also doesnt look as fun\u00a0as HRH....Tavel Agent we were referred to doesn't know all that much about it either she was told it was a \"concrete jungle\" It just seems so our vibe where as all other resorts seem dull in comparison! We are not just limited to DR i was actually trying to stray away from DR due to language barrier and the fact that my fiance's buddy got married in DR a few years ago....but the HRH drew me in.....Do i listen to the reviews or my gut?! help!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"way2radd4u@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.228.88.117","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294711966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235366.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LovesJakeyPoo","Id":235366,"Name":"LovesJakeyPoo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"edc8412b98dcfda6b719c44e33c496ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;Hi there!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve been having the same dilema myself with the Hard Rock Hotel....It looks AMAZING!!!&amp;nbsp; My TA&amp;nbsp; has actually been there recently and she had nothing but great things to say about the resort.&amp;nbsp; Since it&#039;s a former Palace resort she said that there is a&amp;nbsp;5 star standard! I haven&#039;t booked there yet, but it&#039;s definitely the front runner!!&amp;nbsp; I think it&#039;s hard to just &amp;quot;pick&amp;quot; a hotel to have your wedding at without having visited there first.&amp;nbsp; We&#039;ll probably end up booking there anyways, because I can&#039;t stop looking at the pictures!&amp;nbsp; Good luck to you!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1377046,"PostDate":1295199597,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">Hi there!\u00a0 I've been having the same dilema myself with the Hard Rock Hotel....It looks AMAZING!!!\u00a0 My TA\u00a0 has actually been there recently and she had nothing but great things to say about the resort.\u00a0 Since it's a former Palace resort she said that there is a\u00a05 star standard! I haven't booked there yet, but it's definitely the front runner!!\u00a0 I think it's hard to just \"pick\" a hotel to have your wedding at without having visited there first.\u00a0 We'll probably end up booking there anyways, because I can't stop looking at the pictures!\u00a0 Good luck to you!!!<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aahq45@mizzou.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1291898739,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234501.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aahq45","Id":234501,"Name":"aahq45","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b759abf8809a2a3c34c1da010f9d469d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Not surprising that your TA didn&#039;t know much about it, my understanding is it recently opened, it was a buyout of a different resort.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m pretty sure it just opened within the last year.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1377052,"PostDate":1295201172,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Not surprising that your TA didn't know much about it, my understanding is it recently opened, it was a buyout of a different resort.\u00a0 I'm pretty sure it just opened within the last year.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"toriedzelak@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281125244,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231105.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"badgergirl8","Id":231105,"Name":"badgergirl8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6db213482b027cc3e9ac186efe0d143","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We really are having the same dilemma! Please keep me posted on how everything goes if you do decide to book at the HRH! I look frequently at the new reviews....i feel that it is highly possible that they just had a rough soft opening in November and that all the kinks will be ironed out by the time i expect to go in March &#039;12! I did notice that alot of the bad reviews seemed to be from some snobby people bragging about all the am zing places they have traveled...I&#039;m just a simple girl from Cali looking to have a good time and have a beautiful wedding! It would be easier if more of the reviews were about actual wedding events rather than contradicting reviews on everything from the decor! please keep meeh posted i don&#039;t have to book the wedding for another couple months due to travel info restrictions!! thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1378219,"PostDate":1295366860,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We really are having the same dilemma! Please keep me posted on how everything goes if you do decide to book at the HRH! I look frequently at the new reviews....i feel that it is highly possible that they just had a rough soft opening in November and that all the kinks will be ironed out by the time i expect to go in March '12! I did notice that alot of the bad reviews seemed to be from some snobby people bragging about all the am zing places they have traveled...I'm just a simple girl from Cali looking to have a good time and have a beautiful wedding! It would be easier if more of the reviews were about actual wedding events rather than contradicting reviews on everything from the decor! please keep meeh posted i don't have to book the wedding for another couple months due to travel info restrictions!! thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"way2radd4u@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.228.88.117","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294711966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235366.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LovesJakeyPoo","Id":235366,"Name":"LovesJakeyPoo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"177a8908dc71c66795a957b444831b2a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies!   The HRH was a buyout of the Moon Palace if im not mistaken.&amp;nbsp; Attached are&amp;nbsp;a few&amp;nbsp;pics of some of the recption locations we took when touring&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;HRH...&amp;nbsp; They also have a huge convention area that can be reduced to your needed size.&amp;nbsp; Hope this helps.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 047.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261121\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 048.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261123\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 054.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261129\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 061.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261137\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 062.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261142\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 082.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261144\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 083.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261148\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 084.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261150\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 087.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261152\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 099.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261154\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 110.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261157\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 114.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261162\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 123.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261164\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 124.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261166\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  &lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 116.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261189\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 102.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261193\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"dr resorts 2 113.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261197\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1378590,"PostDate":1295388007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies!\u00a0\u00a0 The HRH was a buyout of the Moon Palace if im not mistaken.\u00a0 Attached are\u00a0a few\u00a0pics of some of the recption locations we took when touring\u00a0the\u00a0HRH...\u00a0 They also have a huge convention area that can be reduced to your needed size.\u00a0 Hope this helps.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 047.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261121\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 048.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261123\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 054.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261129\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 061.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261137\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 062.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261142\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 082.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261144\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 083.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261148\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 084.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261150\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 087.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261152\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 099.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261154\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 110.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261157\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 114.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261162\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 123.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261164\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 124.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261166\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 116.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261189\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 102.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261193\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"dr resorts 2 113.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/261197\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janireh14@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1292199168,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234569.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jhern","Id":234569,"Name":"jhern","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0cda44638afeb682e218e198de01de5c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;Thank you SO much for the pictures!!!&amp;nbsp; Did you decide on the HRH for your wedding?  Are there any other tips from your travel there or experience you had with the hotel?&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve read so many mixed reviews that I don&#039;t know what to do!! ;)&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;Thanks!! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1379795,"PostDate":1295531654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">Thank you SO much for the pictures!!!\u00a0 Did you decide on the HRH for your wedding?\u00a0\u00a0Are there any other tips from your travel there or experience you had with the hotel?\u00a0 I've read so many mixed reviews that I don't know what to do!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\u00a0 <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">Thanks!! <\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aahq45@mizzou.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1291898739,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234501.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aahq45","Id":234501,"Name":"aahq45","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f44432147c785932728c5489508c1910","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We visted the NHReal, Paradisus PC, if youd like PM me your email and i&#039;ll frwd you which ever pics you&#039;d like to see.&amp;nbsp; We&#039;ve decided to go with the Majestic Colonial.&amp;nbsp; We didn&#039;t do HRH because we felt the main building was a bit distant from the rooms and beach for us since we are having older guests.&amp;nbsp; The MC works for us because it&amp;nbsp;has everything centrally located and is a bit more convienient.&amp;nbsp; Hope this helped.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1381188,"PostDate":1295669577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We visted the NHReal, Paradisus PC, if youd like PM me your email and i'll frwd you which ever pics you'd like to see.\u00a0 We've decided to go with the Majestic Colonial.\u00a0 We didn't do HRH because we felt the main building was a bit distant from the rooms and beach for us since we are having older guests.\u00a0 The MC works for us because it\u00a0has everything centrally located and is a bit more convienient.\u00a0 Hope this helped.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janireh14@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1292199168,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234569.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jhern","Id":234569,"Name":"jhern","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c3e69f30f694eeabc435b0faa3ac1e5","RawContent":"Sorry I just reread your question... The resort is very nice and the WC we met with was WONDERFUL, I wish she was at the MC.  I understand  the \"concrete jungle,\" reference but I wouldn&#039;t let that steer you away.  They have alot of activities for your guests to do and you can take advantage of the credits they are currently offering.  We also had lunch there and the food was great.  They had a wide variety of options that would likely satisfy any taste.  The entire resort has a grand feel to it.  It has great areas to hold a reception.     \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]aahq45[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=4]Thank you SO much for the pictures!!!  Did you decide on the HRH for your wedding?  Are there any other tips from your travel there or experience you had with the hotel?  I&#039;ve read so many mixed reviews that I don&#039;t know what to do!! ;)  [\/size] \n [size=4]Thanks!! [\/size][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1381196,"PostDate":1295671386,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Sorry\u00a0I just reread your question... The resort is very nice and the\u00a0WC we met with\u00a0was WONDERFUL, I wish she was at the MC.\u00a0 I understand \u00a0the \"concrete jungle,\" reference but I wouldn't let that\u00a0steer\u00a0you away.\u00a0 They have alot of activities for your guests to do and you can take advantage of the credits they are currently offering.\u00a0 We\u00a0also had lunch there and the food was great.\u00a0 They had a wide variety of options\u00a0that would likely satisfy any taste.\u00a0 The entire resort has a grand feel to it.\u00a0\u00a0It has great areas\u00a0to hold a reception.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>aahq45<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">Thank you SO much for the pictures!!!\u00a0 Did you decide on the HRH for your wedding?\u00a0\u00a0Are there any other tips from your travel there or experience you had with the hotel?\u00a0 I've read so many mixed reviews that I don't know what to do!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\u00a0 <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">Thanks!! <\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janireh14@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1292199168,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234569.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jhern","Id":234569,"Name":"jhern","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"58944","Title":"The Hard Rock Punta Cana","LastPostDate":1423591966},"Pages":{"TotalItems":899,"TotalPages":90,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":890},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
