{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11d34e1d773e8af933e8c076b70dec9f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks aahq45!!!&amp;nbsp; The pics look GREAT!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1390004,"PostDate":1296740922,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks aahq45!!!\u00a0 The pics look GREAT!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicole.brown@ymail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1286475738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233004.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JetsettinBride","Id":233004,"Name":"JetsettinBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42d8ac77433fb5f0fd44a983ede98985","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My wedding is booked there for May of 2012. I went through destinationweddings.com. They have been helpful as far as the legalities and booking. If i ask my rep for help with travel plans or pricing info she replies almost immediately but when I ask about anything as far as decorations or dinner, or invitations I am pretty much left in the dark Also, I&#039;m just going crazy because I cannot get any details about the actual wedding. I know they have packages but very little of the pre-made packages really fits with what we want to do. Has anyone actually been down there and seen it in person? I have heard it is amazing...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1452071,"PostDate":1305492137,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My wedding is booked there for May of 2012. I went through destinationweddings.com. They have been helpful as far as the legalities and booking. If i ask my rep for help with travel plans or pricing info she replies almost immediately but when I ask about anything as far as decorations or dinner, or invitations I am pretty much left in the dark Also, I'm just going crazy because I cannot get any details about the actual wedding. I know they have packages but very little of the pre-made packages really fits with what we want to do. Has anyone actually been down there and seen it in person? I have heard it is amazing...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"darklullabye@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305491869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240033.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":256,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JJ512","Id":240033,"Name":"JJ512","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1308de1c6548f441b40706838e5db293","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; JJ512: I booked my wedding for May 12, 2012! What day in May are you getting married? I&#039;m so excited! What questions did you have regarding decorations? Check out this website: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.creativepuntacana.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.creativepuntacana.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;This is the vendor that the hotel uses for decorations, centerpieces, etc... You can contact them for quotes on the decorations you want for your wedding. Hope this helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1453191,"PostDate":1305655287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> JJ512: I booked my wedding for May 12, 2012! What day in May are you getting married? I'm so excited! What questions did you have regarding decorations? Check out this website: <a href='http:\/\/www.creativepuntacana.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.creativepuntacana.com\/<\/a>\u00a0This is the vendor that the hotel uses for decorations, centerpieces, etc... You can contact them for quotes on the decorations you want for your wedding. Hope this helps!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Hard Rock Punta Cana May 12, 2012<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmontankb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1303587312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LalaJ","Id":239192,"Name":"LalaJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6830997b60011ef8e6951eda7a82e51","RawContent":"&lt;p class=\"post-username\" id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305748671175135\"&gt; &lt;span class=\"pmenuShow on\" id=\"pMenu-34822\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/lovesjakeypoo\"&gt;LovesJakeyPoo&lt;\/a&gt; -&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p class=\"post-username\"&gt; &lt;span class=\"pmenuShow on\"&gt;I am getting married at the Hard Rock in October, 2011&amp;nbsp;and I was told that I won&#039;t get a WC assigned to me until 3 months before the wedding.&amp;nbsp; Yikes!! I am a planner just like you so I am not liking that idea at all.&amp;nbsp; I have so many questions to ask once I can actually talk to someone.&amp;nbsp; I will keep you posted :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1453997,"PostDate":1305748884,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class=\"post-username\" id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305748671175135\"> <span class=\"pmenuShow on\" id=\"pMenu-34822\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/lovesjakeypoo' class='bbc_url' title=''>LovesJakeyPoo<\/a> -<\/span><\/p> <p class=\"post-username\"> <span class=\"pmenuShow on\">I am getting married at the Hard Rock in October, 2011\u00a0and I was told that I won't get a WC assigned to me until 3 months before the wedding.\u00a0 Yikes!! I am a planner just like you so I am not liking that idea at all.\u00a0 I have so many questions to ask once I can actually talk to someone.\u00a0 I will keep you posted <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c_breann@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300315241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237884.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Breann","Id":237884,"Name":"Breann","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db25ab861d49306e2d30c37e58d014c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Breann, Have you tried calling the resort directly? I called and asked to be transferred to the wedding department and they answered some questions I had.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1455205,"PostDate":1305901635,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Breann, Have you tried calling the resort directly? I called and asked to be transferred to the wedding department and they answered some questions I had.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Hard Rock Punta Cana May 12, 2012<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmontankb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1303587312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LalaJ","Id":239192,"Name":"LalaJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c445151892d660154e8a83f47520caf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; OMG!! We&#039;ll be bride buddies!! lol We&#039;re getting married the day before you! originally we were getting married on the 12th but we wanted our guests to stay for a whole day after the wedding before they left so we moved it to Friday. I am so excited!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Thank you thank you thank you&lt;\/strong&gt; for the link! &amp;nbsp;That helps so much.&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1455237,"PostDate":1305904815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> OMG!! We'll be bride buddies!! lol We're getting married the day before you! originally we were getting married on the 12th but we wanted our guests to stay for a whole day after the wedding before they left so we moved it to Friday. I am so excited!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Thank you thank you thank you<\/strong> for the link! \u00a0That helps so much.\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"darklullabye@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305491869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240033.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":256,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JJ512","Id":240033,"Name":"JJ512","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee422b742f386c9371e60e8fb4780ea9","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LalaJ[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Breann, Have you tried calling the resort directly? I called and asked to be transferred to the wedding department and they answered some questions I had.[\/quote] \n I did do that but they wouldn&#039;t answer any of my indirect questions.  The lady told me that I will be able to get those questions answered when I get my WC 3 months prior.  Are you having a reception there or back home? We have 35 people coming and we don&#039;t plan on doing a reception there b\/c we are having one back home.  I am really anxious to see what they have set up for after the wedding for all of us to go get a drink somewhere.  I would hate to spend more money on a package deal when everything is all inclusive and seems silly to purchase a food\/drink package.","Attachments":[],"Id":1455511,"PostDate":1305921139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LalaJ<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Breann, Have you tried calling the resort directly? I called and asked to be transferred to the wedding department and they answered some questions I had.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I did do that but they wouldn't answer any of my indirect questions.\u00a0 The lady told me that I will be able to get those questions answered when I get my WC 3 months prior.\u00a0 Are you having a reception there or back home? We have 35 people coming and we don't plan on doing a reception there b\/c we are having one back home.\u00a0 I am really anxious to see what they have set up for after the wedding\u00a0for all of us to go get a drink somewhere.\u00a0 I would hate to spend more money on a package deal when everything is all inclusive and seems silly to purchase a food\/drink package.\u00a0<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c_breann@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300315241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237884.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Breann","Id":237884,"Name":"Breann","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3196f1f07fe1246e73f4c37cb1d2580","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; @ JJ512: OMG sooooooo excited! Maybe I&#039;ll see you once we&#039;re there. I&#039;m arriving at the hotel on the Wednesday before the wedding. Can&#039;t wait!&lt;span alt=\":cheer2:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"43\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" width=\"55\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":cheer2:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\"&gt;@ Breann, I&#039;m having a&amp;nbsp;reception there in one of the rooms they have available inside. I&#039;m expecting to have between 80-100 guests so I figured it would be better to have a private function. I&#039;m hoping to get the free private function they offer which would definitely save me some $$$. I&#039;m sure the dinner they offer for 35 people shouwork out really nice though because they have a lot of restaurants and maybe you&#039;ll be able to go to the hotel&#039;s night club after dinner *hopefully the club will be open by then*, that is if your guests would like to go to a club. I completely understand where you&#039;re coming from though, as far as spending money on a package.&amp;nbsp;The private function is only for 2 hours, after that you have to pay extra so it can add up when you&amp;nbsp;can go&amp;nbsp;to any restaurant in the resort without paying anything extra.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1456403,"PostDate":1306160414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> @ JJ512: OMG sooooooo excited! Maybe I'll see you once we're there. I'm arriving at the hotel on the Wednesday before the wedding. Can't wait!<span alt=\":cheer2:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"43\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" width=\"55\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span alt=\":cheer2:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\">@ Breann, I'm having a\u00a0reception there in one of the rooms they have available inside. I'm expecting to have between 80-100 guests so I figured it would be better to have a private function. I'm hoping to get the free private function they offer which would definitely save me some $$$. I'm sure the dinner they offer for 35 people shouwork out really nice though because they have a lot of restaurants and maybe you'll be able to go to the hotel's night club after dinner *hopefully the club will be open by then*, that is if your guests would like to go to a club. I completely understand where you're coming from though, as far as spending money on a package.\u00a0The private function is only for 2 hours, after that you have to pay extra so it can add up when you\u00a0can go\u00a0to any restaurant in the resort without paying anything extra.<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Hard Rock Punta Cana May 12, 2012<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmontankb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1303587312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LalaJ","Id":239192,"Name":"LalaJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f9c05b519000b94bf87194b76846345","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; hi ladies, i&#039;m new to this site and the FI and I have just decided we would like to have an August 2012 wedding at the Hard Rock PC. &amp;nbsp;What is the best way to go about securing a date there? online or by telephone? Any help you could provide would be greatly appreciated. thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1457651,"PostDate":1306287963,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> hi ladies, i'm new to this site and the FI and I have just decided we would like to have an August 2012 wedding at the Hard Rock PC. \u00a0What is the best way to go about securing a date there? online or by telephone? Any help you could provide would be greatly appreciated. thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanrock31@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1306286854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240386.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DRb2b","Id":240386,"Name":"DRb2b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae4f202d30248bbc2897b882c5daf71f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Girls! So my parents aer actually down there right now checking out hotels for us and they met with the Hard Rock yesterday the WC is Nacny Ruiz. My step mom said she is great. So helpful and so accomadating. We have a date on hold for 10\/27\/2012 btu still going to check out Majestic and Now Larimar is on my list as well. So from what Iheard from my step mom if yuo can get the 75 nights of rooms booked under ag roup rate then its soo wirth it. You can unlimited parties so our welcome party, the wedding (diamond package) would be free, all the food and alcohol, and cake, and the n ext day private brunch.... Plus if you book soon you can get that resort credit which is awesome. I think its like if you book 5 nights then your room gets $1500 in resort credit. My&amp;nbsp; problem with the resort is that its so big and that the outside grounds are not very tropical looking. The inside and the rooms look great and my paretns said they do have that wow factor. They said the outside isnt as pretty as some other reosrts but if you get the wedding food for free then they you can go all out with decor and make the wedding have that wow factor too. I also dont like taht if it rains the only plan b for 100 people, which is what we aer having, wouldbe the ballroom and personally I dont want to be in a windowless ballroom. We are in the caribean for a reason ya know...My paretns come back in mid june and they took pics and video so I can uplaod once I get. Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1463005,"PostDate":1307139406,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Girls! So my parents aer actually down there right now checking out hotels for us and they met with the Hard Rock yesterday the WC is Nacny Ruiz. My step mom said she is great. So helpful and so accomadating. We have a date on hold for 10\/27\/2012 btu still going to check out Majestic and Now Larimar is on my list as well. So from what Iheard from my step mom if yuo can get the 75 nights of rooms booked under ag roup rate then its soo wirth it. You can unlimited parties so our welcome party, the wedding (diamond package) would be free, all the food and alcohol, and cake, and the n ext day private brunch.... Plus if you book soon you can get that resort credit which is awesome. I think its like if you book 5 nights then your room gets $1500 in resort credit. My\u00a0 problem with the resort is that its so big and that the outside grounds are not very tropical looking. The inside and the rooms look great and my paretns said they do have that wow factor. They said the outside isnt as pretty as some other reosrts but if you get the wedding food for free then they you can go all out with decor and make the wedding have that wow factor too. I also dont like taht if it rains the only plan b for 100 people, which is what we aer having, wouldbe the ballroom and personally I dont want to be in a windowless ballroom. We are in the caribean for a reason ya know...My paretns come back in mid june and they took pics and video so I can uplaod once I get. Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ginamapi@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1270845918,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ginamapi","Id":227192,"Name":"ginamapi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":899,"TotalPages":90,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":890},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
